 \u00a0I didn't expect you to change the date at all! \u00a0Sorry I had to cancel, we need to get away for a few days.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have a blast, and I can hopefully make the next evening if there is one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1438177324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e935a8f1234614dda5cd10e4032d83b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@perianjay&amp;nbsp; I kind of agree with you even though it sucks that we can&#039;t accommodate everyone. So I&#039;m good with the 14th if everyone else is.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900367,"PostDate":1436821554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@perianjay\u00a0 I kind of agree with you even though it sucks that we can't accommodate everyone. So I'm good with the 14th if everyone els