{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":272,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":16924,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1712250,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1359326335,"LastPoster":{"Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpg?_r=1438712626","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1712250,"PostDate":1359326335,"PostContent":"Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site   \u00a0  I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45a9b269d22154e94d992cad3e070f05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats to us all!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.231;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712250,"PostDate":1359326335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats to us all!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 13px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"719c72dc28d609b96f2a0d0502f60d93","RawContent":"Congrats to you!!! Besides myself you are the first 2015 bride I&#039;ve seen on here...Happy Planning!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1712283,"PostDate":1359330620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats to you!!! Besides myself you are the first 2015 bride I've seen on here...Happy Planning!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bafc523e16b2231bf3268c7b74ea9724","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations! &amp;nbsp;I was going to be a 2015 bride, Feb 26th, 2015 will be our 10yr dating anniversary. &amp;nbsp;I decided to change it to 12-13-14, besides the fact that its a pretty cool date, we vacation in Jamaica every December so it just seemed perfect for us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712338,"PostDate":1359358855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations! \u00a0I was going to be a 2015 bride, Feb 26th, 2015 will be our 10yr dating anniversary. \u00a0I decided to change it to 12-13-14, besides the fact that its a pretty cool date, we vacation in Jamaica every December so it just seemed perfect for us.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356698759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20cf724e519fa5433f0995696405578c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats snorfle1 ! yes, that is a very cool date.........wishing you all the best with planning your amazing wedding celebration in Jamaica, and that it all works out just the way you wish! Cheers :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359395322899_1018\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"184437\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184437\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; team MTM asst, Lynda :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712424,"PostDate":1359373873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats snorfle1 ! yes, that is a very cool date.........wishing you all the best with planning your amazing wedding celebration in Jamaica, and that it all works out just the way you wish! Cheers <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359395322899_1018\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"184437\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184437\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> team MTM asst, Lynda <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3ec731d403e82cb157623250d0a0b4f","RawContent":"congrats to you!!!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]FutureMrsPerez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site :) \n \n I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.  \n \n My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area. \n \n We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.  \n \n I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas. \n \n I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you! \n \n Congrats to us all!!  \n [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1712436,"PostDate":1359375772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> congrats to you!!!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>FutureMrsPerez<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats to us all!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 13px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9af791e9dd3839c9cdd7383666a7a453","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Welcome to our forum community snorfle1 and Congrats on your wedding in 2015! you&#039;re getting a great head start - which is sure to take off some pressure and give you lots of time to create the wonderful wedding of your dreams in Jamaica! Enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712464,"PostDate":1359377869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Welcome to our forum community snorfle1 and Congrats on your wedding in 2015! you're getting a great head start - which is sure to take off some pressure and give you lots of time to create the wonderful wedding of your dreams in Jamaica! Enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"2012.lyman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1347557781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260336.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":181,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lyman","Id":260336,"Name":"Lyman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"702966b31697e7845671bb48147ffc3d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Marymack\"]\nCongrats to you!!! Besides myself you are the first 2015 bride I&#039;ve seen on here...Happy Planning!!![\/quote] It&#039;s nice to know of another 2015 bride :) how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won&#039;t allow it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1712555,"PostDate":1359383614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Marymack\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1861851\"><p>Congrats to you!!! Besides myself you are the first 2015 bride I've seen on here...Happy Planning!!!<\/p><\/blockquote> It's nice to know of another 2015 bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won't allow it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cac6f026a3fdf5a6def3d801d4e0ade0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"snorfle1\"]\nCongratulations!  I was going to be a 2015 bride, Feb 26th, 2015 will be our 10yr dating anniversary.  I decided to change it to 12-13-14, besides the fact that its a pretty cool date, we vacation in Jamaica every December so it just seemed perfect for us. [\/quote] That is an awesome date :) it&#039;s nice that you have a tradition of going to Jamaica. Good luck on your planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1712558,"PostDate":1359383748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"snorfle1\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1861906\"><p>Congratulations! \u00a0I was going to be a 2015 bride, Feb 26th, 2015 will be our 10yr dating anniversary. \u00a0I decided to change it to 12-13-14, besides the fact that its a pretty cool date, we vacation in Jamaica every December so it just seemed perfect for us.\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> That is an awesome date <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> it's nice that you have a tradition of going to Jamaica. Good luck on your planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad465f1b91f25a512a6c4855e2e1426e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsPerez\"]\nIt&#039;s nice to know of another 2015 bride :) how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won&#039;t allow it.[\/quote]Well I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....","Attachments":[],"Id":1712610,"PostDate":1359389738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"FutureMrsPerez\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862123\"><p>It's nice to know of another 2015 bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won't allow it.<\/p><\/blockquote>Well I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26a64ba4adf44f415f76842dd75f7f62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello FutureMrsPerez: time flies when u are having fun and u will planning this wedding!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The best u can do is GET INFORMED!! read, post, listen, get online as much as u can and talk to brides who &#039;did it&#039;- I can send you a few emails so you can talk to the experts!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ALso do not fear to go and come down to Mexico, visit Cancun and Playa and get to talk with a lot of Wedding PLanners, u will click with one!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; the best to do is discover the market and plunge into it. Have fun, don&#039;t be shy and ask for help as much as you will need&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maria&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712699,"PostDate":1359401101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello FutureMrsPerez: time flies when u are having fun and u will planning this wedding!!<\/p> <p> The best u can do is GET INFORMED!! read, post, listen, get online as much as u can and talk to brides who 'did it'- I can send you a few emails so you can talk to the experts!<\/p> <p> ALso do not fear to go and come down to Mexico, visit Cancun and Playa and get to talk with a lot of Wedding PLanners, u will click with one!<\/p> <p> the best to do is discover the market and plunge into it. Have fun, don't be shy and ask for help as much as you will need<\/p> <p> Maria<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@weddingsinplaya.com","IpAddress":"187.252.51.107","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1313702805,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244100.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"weddingsinplaya","Id":244100,"Name":"weddingsinplaya","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"72192","Title":"2015 Bride Here :)","LastPostDate":1438676438},"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
