{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf365ecba31958cd8777d57bcf4882f1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Marymack[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Well I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....[\/quote] \n Wow you are ahead of the game! That&#039;s awesome! Congrats on 25 years :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1712857,"PostDate":1359455117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Marymack<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Well I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....<\/blockquote> <p> Wow you are ahead of the game! That's awesome! Congrats on 25 years <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0661ceeaed947b542fbc958987db05fc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsPerez\"]\nIt&#039;s nice to know of another 2015 bride :) how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won&#039;t allow it.[\/quote] Hi Future Mrs Perez I am also a 2015 bride in the same boat. I am from the UK and the travel agents here will not book for August 2015 until April 2014! That seems like so far away but I am looking into everything &amp; getting as many ideas as possible now so I can book straight away. This forum is full of fab ideas. Good luck with your planning x","Attachments":[],"Id":1712975,"PostDate":1359468656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"FutureMrsPerez\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862123\"><p>It's nice to know of another 2015 bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> how far along in your planning are you? My fianc\u00a9 and I have just started. There is so much I want to do but cannot book yet since some places won't allow it.<\/p><\/blockquote> Hi Future Mrs Perez I am also a 2015 bride in the same boat. I am from the UK and the travel agents here will not book for August 2015 until April 2014! That seems like so far away but I am looking into everything & getting as many ideas as possible now so I can book straight away. This forum is full of fab ideas. Good luck with your planning x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Lfcgirl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347805769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lfcgirl88","Id":260402,"Name":"Lfcgirl88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8a8add6766454cbed0514d51ba229c6","RawContent":"Thanks so much!!! I am so excited!![quote name=\"FutureMrsPerez\"]\nWow you are ahead of the game! That&#039;s awesome! Congrats on 25 years :) [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1713026,"PostDate":1359472741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks so much!!! I am so excited!!<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"FutureMrsPerez\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862425\"><p>Wow you are ahead of the game! That's awesome! Congrats on 25 years <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bd92832d9ab3c13f9bd3f379e2eb49f","RawContent":"Also I&#039;m from Chicago....Far Southside born and raised but live in Georgia now...","Attachments":[],"Id":1713027,"PostDate":1359472875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Also I'm from Chicago....Far Southside born and raised but live in Georgia now...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e48b536f273030b6f114b1fec968a25b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we&#039;re also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It&#039;s either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713031,"PostDate":1359473052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we're also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It's either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divine_chaos@live.com","IpAddress":"50.142.172.98","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350764582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261579.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TropicalBride10","Id":261579,"Name":"TropicalBride10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ed483f383757a12bd4b76c5ab316a0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on your engagement, TropicalBride10! and on your 25th, Marymac ! wishing you all the best with your plans going forward.......you have lots of time with your 2015 dates :) Enjoy !&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359495383449_1237\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"184660\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; team MTM asst, Lynda :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713041,"PostDate":1359474044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on your engagement, TropicalBride10! and on your 25th, Marymac ! wishing you all the best with your plans going forward.......you have lots of time with your 2015 dates <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Enjoy !<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359495383449_1237\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"184660\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> team MTM asst, Lynda <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd85b8e05b787e3899c38b281ec417b7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TropicalBride10[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we&#039;re also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It&#039;s either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!![\/quote] \n How exciting :) I love knowing of other brides for 2015. Congrats to you too!  You are right we have plenty of time but it will be here before we know it!! :D both places you are looking at seem beautiful! I&#039;m looking forward to hearing your wedding progress. When in 2015 were you thinking?","Attachments":[],"Id":1713075,"PostDate":1359476820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TropicalBride10<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we're also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It's either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> How exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I love knowing of other brides for 2015. Congrats to you too! \u00a0You are right we have plenty of time but it will be here before we know it!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> both places you are looking at seem beautiful! I'm looking forward to hearing your wedding progress. When in 2015 were you thinking?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e8b92868adc9689f1705e9ebdf65d51","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Marymack\"]\nWell I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....[\/quote] Wow congratulations on 25 years Mary, you are also super organised!","Attachments":[],"Id":1713090,"PostDate":1359477983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Marymack\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862178\"><p>Well I am actually renewing my vows for my 25th anniversary.I picked the resort,paid my wedding deposit to hold my day,ordered my invites,and will purchase my dress after attending trunk show on FEB.22... Also have booked my photographer.....<\/p><\/blockquote> Wow congratulations on 25 years Mary, you are also super organised!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Lfcgirl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347805769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lfcgirl88","Id":260402,"Name":"Lfcgirl88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dbee9a60208712417fdbeb9dd5e4de3","RawContent":"Good afternoon ladies! I will be a 2015 bride and I am so happy that I&#039;m not alone. I keep hearing why not next year but we are not ready right now. We decided last weekend to do a destination wedding in Cancun. This forum has helped so much with the details from everyone. I look forward to planning and hopefully helping someone else if I can.","Attachments":[],"Id":1713106,"PostDate":1359480144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good afternoon ladies! I will be a 2015 bride and I am so happy that I'm not alone. I keep hearing why not next year but we are not ready right now. We decided last weekend to do a destination wedding in Cancun. This forum has helped so much with the details from everyone. I look forward to planning and hopefully helping someone else if I can.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chalonda26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359479090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpg?_r=1438712626","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"crcombs","Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d079a5bfbb248f96c803cda17390b99d","RawContent":"Thanks so much!!! [quote name=\"Moments That Matter\"]\nCongrats on your engagement, TropicalBride10! and on your 25th, Marymac ! wishing you all the best with your plans going forward.......you have lots of time with your 2015 dates :) Enjoy ! [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"*\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"184660\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"333\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 500px; height: 333px;\" width=\"500\"&gt; [\/url] team MTM asst, Lynda :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1713176,"PostDate":1359491144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks so much!!! <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Moments That Matter\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862609\"><p>Congrats on your engagement, TropicalBride10! and on your 25th, Marymac ! wishing you all the best with your plans going forward.......you have lots of time with your 2015 dates <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Enjoy ! <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"184660\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"333\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184660\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 500px; height: 333px;\" width=\"500\"><\/span> <\/a> team MTM asst, Lynda <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr.