{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f68efedfafcc46274ee1841b833b497a","RawContent":"I have just done all that recently. I am on a budget and I have learned the early bird always gets a prize.Thanks though!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1713178,"PostDate":1359491355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have just done all that recently. I am on a budget and I have learned the early bird always gets a prize.Thanks though!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc239fd005504f907e0977f2950f5fb2","RawContent":"Wow 2015 in the building!!! Congrats and remember make it fun! The process should be as memorable as the moment.","Attachments":[],"Id":1713196,"PostDate":1359492961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow 2015 in the building!!! Congrats and remember make it fun! The process should be as memorable as the moment.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><span>2.14.14 I can not wait to marry my very best friend ... Again!<\/span><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cherinashaw@me.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1346278707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259797.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cherina","Id":259797,"Name":"Cherina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f2377fd17a2a0465d20e9b07ce4850e","RawContent":"Yes sir...we got a thread!!!! LOL Excited!!!![quote name=\"Cherina\"]\nWow 2015 in the building!!! Congrats and remember make it fun! The process should be as memorable as the moment.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1713212,"PostDate":1359494991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes sir...we got a thread!!!! LOL Excited!!!!<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Cherina\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here#post_1862764\"><p>Wow 2015 in the building!!! Congrats and remember make it fun! The process should be as memorable as the moment.<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1088f94ae5be492ea4ee11ef6e12bf12","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TropicalBride10[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we&#039;re also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It&#039;s either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!![\/quote] \n It is so nice knowing of all of the 2015 brides. :) I&#039;m looking forward to hearing about your wedding progress since we almost should be on the same timeline. When in 2015 were you looking to get married? St. Lucia or Honduras both sound very romantic and memorable.","Attachments":[],"Id":1713214,"PostDate":1359495394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TropicalBride10<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84480\/2015-bride-here\/10#post_1862599' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congrats on your engagement!! My fiance and I have been engaged for two years and we're also looking at 2015! I just turned 21 so I definitely know how you feel. It's either St. Lucia or Honduras at this point but we have plenty of time to figure it out. Happy Planning!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> It is so nice knowing of all of the 2015 brides. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm looking forward to hearing about your wedding progress since we almost should be on the same timeline. When in 2015 were you looking to get married? St. Lucia or Honduras both sound very romantic and memorable.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdeb3662f98afd6e629f41f65768829d","RawContent":"Mary are you 2015?","Attachments":[],"Id":1713217,"PostDate":1359495691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mary are you 2015?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><span>2.14.14 I can not wait to marry my very best friend ... Again!<\/span><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cherinashaw@me.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1346278707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259797.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cherina","Id":259797,"Name":"Cherina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a1f497f5d0a1b38d1d0817fcf5d2b93","RawContent":"Yes,I thought you knew.I got married in 1990,so 2015 will be 25 years for us!!!! I tell ya its been a journey....","Attachments":[],"Id":1713221,"PostDate":1359496004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes,I thought you knew.I got married in 1990,so 2015 will be 25 years for us!!!! I tell ya its been a journey....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45ffad53b13670254fdd1ca899f8cc19","RawContent":"Cool you are wayyyyy ahead of the curve! I FB messaged you","Attachments":[],"Id":1713239,"PostDate":1359497860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Cool you are wayyyyy ahead of the curve! I FB messaged you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><span>2.14.14 I can not wait to marry my very best friend ... Again!<\/span><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cherinashaw@me.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1346278707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259797.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cherina","Id":259797,"Name":"Cherina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"832fdf5238d4813783829f07aae71bc1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]FutureMrsPerez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n It is so nice knowing of all of the 2015 brides. :) I&#039;m looking forward to hearing about your wedding progress since we almost should be on the same timeline. When in 2015 were you looking to get married? St. Lucia or Honduras both sound very romantic and memorable.[\/quote] \n Thank you so much for your well wishes!! We are looking at possibly Oct 2015 because everything is cheaper four guests and St. Lucia and Honduras rarely see hurricanes anyway. When we first started looking we were dead set on the Dominican Republic but it just never really felt right because Punta Cana is highly commercialized and so many people get married there. My family asked us to not consider Mexico and Jamaica doesn&#039;t really have the feel we&#039;re looking for so we started looking at the other islands and everything was either too expensive or to difficult to get to until we started researching St. Lucia. When we first started looking at photos we just completely in love with the Pitons in Soufriere and we&#039;ve been speaking with a wedding planner who&#039;s been extremely helpful but it is a tad bit expensive because we&#039;d have to import our flowers but the unspoiled beauty was enough for us but then we came across Roatan Island, Honduras which is just as beautiful. It&#039;s a little more touristy then we&#039;d like but we&#039;re still able to have the privacy that we&#039;re looking for and I honestly think people would laugh if I told them how affordable it is because they probably wouldn&#039;t believe me. Plus, both St. Lucia and Honduras are not the typical destination wedding locations and it would give our family a chance at a dream vacation that they probably wouldn&#039;t have otherwise but I look forward to following your wedding planning process and congrats to all you ladies on you engagement. It may be a long way off but good things come to those who wait :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1713343,"PostDate":1359513223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>FutureMrsPerez<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84480\/2015-bride-here\/20#post_1862782' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> It is so nice knowing of all of the 2015 brides. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm looking forward to hearing about your wedding progress since we almost should be on the same timeline. When in 2015 were you looking to get married? St. Lucia or Honduras both sound very romantic and memorable.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thank you so much for your well wishes!! We are looking at possibly Oct 2015 because everything is cheaper four guests and St. Lucia and Honduras rarely see hurricanes anyway. When we first started looking we were dead set on the Dominican Republic but it just never really felt right because Punta Cana is highly commercialized and so many people get married there. My family asked us to not consider Mexico and Jamaica doesn't really have the feel we're looking for so we started looking at the other islands and everything was either too expensive or to difficult to get to until we started researching St. Lucia. When we first started looking at photos we just completely in love with the Pitons in Soufriere and we've been speaking with a wedding planner who's been extremely helpful but it is a tad bit expensive because we'd have to import our flowers but the unspoiled beauty was enough for us but then we came across Roatan Island, Honduras which is just as beautiful. It's a little more touristy then we'd like but we're still able to have the privacy that we're looking for and I honestly think people would laugh if I told them how affordable it is because they probably wouldn't believe me. Plus, both St. Lucia and Honduras are not the typical destination wedding locations and it would give our family a chance at a dream vacation that they probably wouldn't have otherwise but I look forward to following your wedding planning process and congrats to all you ladies on you engagement. It may be a long way off but good things come to those who wait <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divine_chaos@live.com","IpAddress":"50.142.172.98","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350764582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261579.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TropicalBride10","Id":261579,"Name":"TropicalBride10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"beb0b5abdcbccb14ac5a1a26f2ed1c74","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]FutureMrsPerez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site :) \n \n I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.  \n \n My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area. \n \n We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.  \n \n I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas. \n \n I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you! \n \n Congrats to us all!!  \n [\/quote] \n Hello FutureMrsPerez, \n \n Congratulation on your engagement and and [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome4.gif[\/img] to the forum, there is a lot of helpful information on here and you have chosen a beautiful location Riviera Maya!  \n \n Fee free to ask us anything and we will be happy to help. \n \n Happy Planning \n Joyce!","Attachments":[],"Id":1713447,"PostDate":1359548678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>FutureMrsPerez<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84480\/2015-bride-here#post_1861818' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Everyone! I am so excited to be on this site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got engaged on July 18, 2012 (my 20th birthday) at the Brookfield Zoo Dolphin Show. I was completely surprised and now I could not be happier.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiance and I have been dating 5 years and we will get married on May 25, 2015 somewhere in the Cancun area.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have been looking at the Gran Caribe Real Resort so far. To us, it seems like a very pretty and romantic place to start our future.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would love any opinions that any of you would like to share. My fiance and I are very open to different ideas.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I look forward to hearing all of your plans and sharing mine with all of you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats to us all!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 13px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hello FutureMrsPerez,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulation on your engagement and and\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359562484001_1699\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome4.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span>\u00a0to the forum, there is a lot of helpful information on here and you have chosen a beautiful location Riviera Maya!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Fee free to ask us anything and we will be happy to help.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning<\/p> <p> Joyce!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7780187809d12b070b4d98b1fe927495","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations to all! I am happy to know I am not the only one that is planning so far out. I just started looking at resorts so once that is decided we can send out our STD. I have been reading and seeing so many good things it&#039;s hard to decide. With the date being so far off I&#039;m sure to change my mind so many times. I am not sure if it&#039;s too early to do a lot of things.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Chalonda&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1718969,"PostDate":1360520433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations to all! I am happy to know I am not the only one that is planning so far out. I just started looking at resorts so once that is decided we can send out our STD. I have been reading and seeing so many good things it's hard to decide. With the date being so far off I'm sure to change my mind so many times. I am not sure if it's too early to do a lot of things.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Chalonda<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chalonda26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359479090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpg?_r=1438712626","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"crcombs","Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
