> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9b2ddcd710c1d0f8db1f7fe37d9f5e4","RawContent":"Hi Chalonda!!! Nope you aren&#039;t the only one....LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":1718995,"PostDate":1360525033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Chalonda!!! Nope you aren't the only one....LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18c89c9ac9d46d4571d182aa54dd0332","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]crcombs[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Congratulations to all! I am happy to know I am not the only one that is planning so far out. I just started looking at resorts so once that is decided we can send out our STD. I have been reading and seeing so many good things it&#039;s hard to decide. With the date being so far off I&#039;m sure to change my mind so many times. I am not sure if it&#039;s too early to do a lot of things. \n \n Chalonda[\/quote] \n \n You will likely change your mind a few times before settling on the resort. I&#039;m a 2013 bride, but I started planning in 2011, so I understand what it&#039;s like to start so far in advance. We thought we had decided on our venue at least three times before actually booking. We fell in love with one resort before learning we couldn&#039;t bring in our preferred photographer, for instance. If there&#039;s anything you&#039;re really set on, especially things that require outside vendors, make sure you check out the resort policies.  \n \n If you come across a vendor you really like (a wedding planner, photographer, make-up artist, etc.), you might want to ask them for opinions about which resorts they prefer to work at. They&#039;ve likely seen them all and can give you insights from behind the curtain, so to speak. \n \n Good luck to everyone planning &amp;amp; congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":1719122,"PostDate":1360562744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>crcombs<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84480\/2015-bride-here\/20#post_1868537' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congratulations to all! I am happy to know I am not the only one that is planning so far out. I just started looking at resorts so once that is decided we can send out our STD. I have been reading and seeing so many good things it's hard to decide. With the date being so far off I'm sure to change my mind so many times. I am not sure if it's too early to do a lot of things.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Chalonda<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You will likely change your mind a few times before settling on the resort. I'm a 2013 bride, but I started planning in 2011, so I understand what it's like to start so far in advance. We thought we had decided on our venue at least three times before actually booking. We fell in love with one resort before learning we couldn't bring in our preferred photographer, for instance. If there's anything you're really set on, especially things that require outside vendors, make sure you check out the resort policies.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you come across a vendor you really like (a wedding planner, photographer, make-up artist, etc.), you might want to ask them for opinions about which resorts they prefer to work at. They've likely seen them all and can give you insights from behind the curtain, so to speak.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck to everyone planning & congratulations!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheranymail@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311860693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242901.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cherany","Id":242901,"Name":"cherany","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7355f913f3b4064d3d6e5841e80f3ff","RawContent":"So my fianc\u00a9 and I have opted not to go to the Gran Caribe Real resort, it turns out that it is not really in our price range. Anyone have any opinions on any resorts that are beautiful and in the 700-800$ a night for all inclusive range in Rivera Maya or Playa Del Carmen? I would live to hear any suggestions. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1723707,"PostDate":1361399141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So my fianc\u00c3\u00a9 and I have opted not to go to the Gran Caribe Real resort, it turns out that it is not really in our price range. Anyone have any opinions on any resorts that are beautiful and in the 700-800$ a night for all inclusive range in Rivera Maya or Playa Del Carmen? I would live to hear any suggestions. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifern.h718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.158.223.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358936630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264931.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsPerez","Id":264931,"Name":"FutureMrsPerez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23ea0fea6f3eb5451f37251a4637eb76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats and welcome!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1725079,"PostDate":1361719073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats and welcome!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristen112808@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.194.249.198","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1360838243,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266061.jpg?_r=1415545079","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristen112808","Id":266061,"Name":"Kristen112808","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd07a50b89191ab082020d6aac67a683","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]FutureMrsPerez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n So my fianc\u00a9 and I have opted not to go to the Gran Caribe Real resort, it turns out that it is not really in our price range.\n \n Anyone have any opinions on any resorts that are beautiful and in the 700-800$ a night for all inclusive range in Rivera Maya or Playa Del Carmen? I would live to hear any suggestions. :)[\/quote] \n \n We&#039;re mini-mooning at The Royal in Playa del Carmen, an adults only all-inclusive. The cost was actually less than what you&#039;re looking for, so you might want to check them out. If you need a place that allows kids, they have a sister property right across that&#039;s a family place. We got a better price going through cheapcaribbean.com, but some friends said they got a better deal directly through the hotel, so it might depend on when you book.","Attachments":[],"Id":1733595,"PostDate":1363250362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>FutureMrsPerez<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84480\/2015-bride-here\/30#post_1873275' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> So my fianc\u00c3\u00a9 and I have opted not to go to the Gran Caribe Real resort, it turns out that it is not really in our price range.<br \/> <br \/> Anyone have any opinions on any resorts that are beautiful and in the 700-800$ a night for all inclusive range in Rivera Maya or Playa Del Carmen? I would live to hear any suggestions. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're mini-mooning at The Royal in Playa del Carmen, an adults only all-inclusive. The cost was actually less than what you're looking for, so you might want to check them out. If you need a place that allows kids, they have a sister property right across that's a family place. We got a better price going through cheapcaribbean.com, but some friends said they got a better deal directly through the hotel, so it might depend on when you book.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheranymail@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311860693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242901.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":253,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cherany","Id":242901,"Name":"cherany","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b687d8d1b0a1f5fe43f879f3c736d8d1","RawContent":"Congrats ladies! At the rate I&#039;m going I will be a 2015 bride too! We can&#039;t decide on a resort. Once we narrow down a few choices...the dates are booked. It&#039;s so hard to decide. What are your top choices? I saw someone said Gran Caribe.","Attachments":[],"Id":1740242,"PostDate":1364637849,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats ladies! At the rate I'm going I will be a 2015 bride too! We can't decide on a resort. Once we narrow down a few choices...the dates are booked. It's so hard to decide. What are your top choices? I saw someone said Gran Caribe.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ana_Steele58@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.72.227.220","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359137473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265082.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnaSteele58","Id":265082,"Name":"AnaSteele58","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71dbba4f5bb92d625424183e3f31f286","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats and Welcome!!!! It&#039;s never to early to start planning :)&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740254,"PostDate":1364644991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats and Welcome!!!! It's never to early to start planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac34470332cb63e555d9dec4b3706992","RawContent":"Hi Ana.... I am doing Sandals Montego Bay...[quote name=\"AnaSteele58\"]\nCongrats ladies! At the rate I&#039;m going I will be a 2015 bride too! We can&#039;t decide on a resort. Once we narrow down a few choices...the dates are booked. It&#039;s so hard to decide. What are your top choices? I saw someone said Gran Caribe.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1740258,"PostDate":1364645475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ana.... I am doing Sandals Montego Bay...<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"AnaSteele58\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here\/30#post_1889811\"><p>Congrats ladies! At the rate I'm going I will be a 2015 bride too! We can't decide on a resort. Once we narrow down a few choices...the dates are booked. It's so hard to decide. What are your top choices? I saw someone said Gran Caribe.<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb3ffdf88d20d78e02a85ee979b8fd45","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on your wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1743218,"PostDate":1365422717,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on your wedding!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Tiarra <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">February 14th 2015 *A celebration of Love* <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Isla Mujeres<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"><em>\"And now abide faith, hope, love, these three; but the greatest of these <i>is<\/i> love.\"<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"tiarrajones0913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.92.9.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365416634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268317.jpg?_r=1387755717","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TiarraBeautyJ","Id":268317,"Name":"TiarraBeautyJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89d8a958ba8296481fbd2e1414e5aaad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As a Wedding planner here in the Riviera Maya,would like to say c&lt;span style=\"line-height: 1.231;\"&gt;ongrats on an early start ladies, you will have plenty of time to shop around until you find thee location of your dream. please feel free to ask anything or advice and we will be happy to help.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"line-height: 1.231;\"&gt;you can email us at weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Joyce!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1745502,"PostDate":1366038910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As a Wedding planner here in the Riviera Maya,would like to say c<span>ongrats on an early start ladies, you will have plenty of time to shop around until you find thee location of your dream. please feel free to ask anything or advice and we will be happy to help.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>you can email us at weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning<\/p> <p> Joyce!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"