re\/40#post_1902434' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> My fianc\u00c3\u00a9 and I think we have settled on the the right resort as well... Royal Solaris Cancun.<br \/> <br \/> I know I am supper excited <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\"  style=\"display:none\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Form