n":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d49652d9670daf7908b6b984c2251515","RawContent":"My TA has given me a September time frame for 2015 rates. It probably also depends on the resort![quote name=\"crcombs\"]\nHas anyone been able to get 2015 rates? I am being told we can&#039;t get rates or book anything until November of this year. I want to send save the dates out to give everyone a chance to prepare accordingly.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1756824,"PostDate":1368223527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My TA has given me a September time frame for 2015 rates. It probably also depends on the resort!<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"crcombs\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here\/30#post_1904883\"><p>Has anyone been able to get 2015 rates? I am being told we can't get rates or book anything until November of this year. I want to send save the dates out to give everyone a chance to prepare accordingly.<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wylieinc@nu-z.net","IpAddress":"173.233.176.146","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352928759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":214,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marymack","Id":262378,"Name":"Marymack","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bd014f13050741d7d3bbd8c25ce5374","RawContent":"Thanks! I just wanted to make sure it wasn&#039;t only me lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1757102,"PostDate":1368359613,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks! I just wanted to make sure it wasn't only me lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chalonda26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359479090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpg?_r=1438712626","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"crcombs","Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74434d99ac4474b24606ba76434e864c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Woooo! I am so relieved to not be the only 2015 bride! Congrats to you all on your engagement! And for those of you that already picked your resort - I&#039;m so happy for you! I haven&#039;t even decided on an actual date - just a tentative one: March 7, 2015! Fiance and I like it but aren&#039;t completely set on it yet. :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763172,"PostDate":1370024386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Woooo! I am so relieved to not be the only 2015 bride! Congrats to you all on your engagement! And for those of you that already picked your resort - I'm so happy for you! I haven't even decided on an actual date - just a tentative one: March 7, 2015! Fiance and I like it but aren't completely set on it yet. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julzap@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369845719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270100.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"itsjuliez","Id":270100,"Name":"itsjuliez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94391c51ae1b8e4209d8cd9773047a7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations everybody :)\n \n I&#039;m looking at January 2015, no day selected yet though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763411,"PostDate":1370100621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations everybody <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> I'm looking at January 2015, no day selected yet though.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dubhreubel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.52.246.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369122651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269805.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephLB","Id":269805,"Name":"StephLB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2ef38ea1116e682c73ab0a04cd1db8c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats! &amp;nbsp;My FI and I are looking at April 2015 (fingers crossed for April 30) and are torn between Secrets St. James\/Wild Orchid and the Rose Hall Suites.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1778448,"PostDate":1373826554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats! \u00a0My FI and I are looking at April 2015 (fingers crossed for April 30) and are torn between Secrets St. James\/Wild Orchid and the Rose Hall Suites.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tamiko.isaacs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.249.162.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368884340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269708.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tamiks","Id":269708,"Name":"tamiks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a318094e3892d3ee055d4b1bf38e628e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats newbie brides - on your destination weddings coming up in 2015 !!!&amp;nbsp; you have lots of time for research + making decisions - nice :) Wishing you all the best with your plans, and that your Wedding Celebrations are everything you envision.......CHeers :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1049\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213022\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213022\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1455\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213023\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213023\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1853\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213024\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213024\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_2265\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213025\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213025\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_2652\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213026\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213026\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374523780418_1133\"&gt; Photography Is Forever Studios &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213374\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780224,"PostDate":1374169417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats newbie brides - on your destination weddings coming up in 2015 !!!\u00a0 you have lots of time for research + making decisions - nice <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Wishing you all the best with your plans, and that your Wedding Celebrations are everything you envision.......CHeers <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1049\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213022\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213022\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213022\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1455\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213023\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213023\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213023\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_1853\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213024\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213024\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213024\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_2265\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213025\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213025\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213025\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374186632960_2652\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213026\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213026\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213026\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374523780418_1133\"> Photography Is Forever Studios <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213374\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213374\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372797157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28d3831255038577f869f386c411787c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; YAY!!!! Add me to the list of 2015 brides. April 25, 2015. We decided our destination would be Cancun, Mexico at the Now Jade resort. We have received rates already for our travel agent and plan to do our room block and wedding deposit sometime next month.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780325,"PostDate":1374193440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> YAY!!!! Add me to the list of 2015 brides. April 25, 2015. We decided our destination would be Cancun, Mexico at the Now Jade resort. We have received rates already for our travel agent and plan to do our room block and wedding deposit sometime next month.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brendaterrell87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.227.138.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372784755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271135.jpg?_r=1397490906","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kaiden1215","Id":271135,"Name":"Kaiden1215","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b7f9e9d953bf65097a506187a03adc9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats Kaiden1215!!! The NOW Jade is an excellent wedding venue.......as seen in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc recorded there......with more at &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213109\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213109\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213107\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213107\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213108\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213108\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"213110\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213110\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; .team MTM asst, Lynda :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780555,"PostDate":1374246395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats Kaiden1215!!! The NOW Jade is an excellent wedding venue.......as seen in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc recorded there......with more at <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150238144924487.334265.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>the album link here<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213109\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213109\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213109\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213107\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213107\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213107\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213108\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"213108\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213108\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213110\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"213110\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213110\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> .team MTM asst, Lynda <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignatur