{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a51f93a56f486d6cf8b51d735425640","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Recy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Yes. I am having the ame problem. I want to give my guest at least 10 months to plan and pay for their travel. Hopefully with me moving my date the extra time will help.[\/quote] \n I was able to get my 2015 rates for Now Jade from my travel agent. You might want to check with a travel agent to see if they can use their direct contact to get your the information","Attachments":[],"Id":1783750,"PostDate":1374873851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Recy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yes. I am having the ame problem. I want to give my guest at least 10 months to plan and pay for their travel. Hopefully with me moving my date the extra time will help.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I was able to get my 2015 rates for Now Jade from my travel agent. You might want to check with a travel agent to see if they can use their direct contact to get your the information<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brendaterrell87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.227.138.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372784755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271135.jpg?_r=1397490906","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kaiden1215","Id":271135,"Name":"Kaiden1215","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f59067e4d4bbc51d759418f78b77798b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kaiden1215\"]\nI was able to get my 2015 rates for Now Jade from my travel agent. You might want to check with a travel agent to see if they can use their direct contact to get your the information[\/quote] Thank you! I will get on that Monday morning.","Attachments":[],"Id":1783763,"PostDate":1374876071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Kaiden1215\" url=\"\/t\/84480\/2015&#045;bride&#045;here\/60#post_1931819\"><p>I was able to get my 2015 rates for Now Jade from my travel agent. You might want to check with a travel agent to see if they can use their direct contact to get your the information<\/p><\/blockquote> Thank you! I will get on that Monday morning.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong><span>\"Make or accept no excuses. You are where you are today (and will be tomorrow) as a result of what you did or did not do yesterday.\"<\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"wedding4marshalls@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370685484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270378.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Recy","Id":270378,"Name":"Recy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f17a4b91e7e52f93bda8712552582a86","RawContent":"Hello fellow 2015 Brides. We just sent our deposit for our Thanksgiving Day 2015 wedding at the Secrets Wild Orchid resort in Jamaica. Waiting for our confirmation. I am so excited. I know it&#039;s at least 2 years away, but I am still excited. :D Happy planning everybody!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1784045,"PostDate":1374945916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello fellow 2015 Brides. We just sent our deposit for our Thanksgiving Day 2015 wedding at the Secrets Wild Orchid resort in Jamaica. Waiting for our confirmation. I am so excited. I know it's at least 2 years away, but I am still excited. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> Happy planning everybody!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6c8139aa01c0fab55c8daca308b6fe0","RawContent":"Congrats RandL2015!!!! That time will fly by! We planning to book ours in August.","Attachments":[],"Id":1784049,"PostDate":1374946817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats RandL2015!!!! That time will fly by! We planning to book ours in August.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brendaterrell87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.227.138.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372784755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271135.jpg?_r=1397490906","PhotoWidth":180,"Pho