Content":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, Congrats RandL2015! reserving your wedding venue is such a big decision, and cornerstone of your plans - well done!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Now you have lots of time for the rest of it to slot into place with minimal stress......Enjoy !!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214252\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214252\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214253\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214253\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_1581\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214254\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214254\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_1963\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214255\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214255\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_2355\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214256\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214256\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_3255\"&gt; Photography Is Forever Studios&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"214257\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214257\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1784057,"PostDate":1374950342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, Congrats RandL2015! reserving your wedding venue is such a big decision, and cornerstone of your plans - well done!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now you have lots of time for the rest of it to slot into place with minimal stress......Enjoy !!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214252\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214252\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214253\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214253\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_1581\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214254\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214254\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_1963\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214255\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214255\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_2355\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214256\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214256\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374967931077_3255\"> Photography Is Forever Studios\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"214257\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/214257\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372797157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"577076a00bb81e1649da7a2bf46d14b5","RawContent":"So happy to finally receive my confirmation to have our wedding at the Secrets Wild Orchid Resort on Thanksgiving Day 2015!! Now, my goal is to sit back, relax, and bargain shop until next year. :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1786373,"PostDate":1375398293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So happy to finally receive my confirmation to have our wedding at the Secrets Wild Orchid Resort on Thanksgiving Day 2015!! Now, my goal is to sit back, relax, and bargain shop until next year. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \