{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1386361445,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62cd45b6f197561c18d394eeeb0d3e79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;you&#039;re so Right, amarie4713! Lots of great info here to help with planning decisions, and lend support (or lean on it - whichever you need at the time) to all your fellow wedding couples here - Enjoy your journey!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:71390]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Photography Is Forever Studios&amp;nbsp; [sharedmedia=gallery:images:72463]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;p.s. being based in Playa del Carmen, we&#039;re totally biased toward thinking Mexico is The Best......lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1818423,"PostDate":1386361006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>you're so Right, amarie4713! Lots of great info here to help with planning decisions, and lend support (or lean on it - whichever you need at the time) to all your fellow wedding couples here - Enjoy your journey!!!<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/71390--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17190\/sml_gallery_73233_17190_1386232459_227603.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='\n' id='sml_image_view_71390' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<p>Photography Is Forever Studios\u00a0 <!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/72463--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_16395\/sml_gallery_73233_16395_1386232553_229533.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='\n'  width='25' height='26'  alt='\n' id='sml_image_view_72463' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>p.s. being based in Playa del Carmen, we're totally biased toward thinking Mexico is The Best......lol<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372797157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.228.200.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53770a7275590f9ba4e488f4b7ba866c","RawContent":"Hi ladies!! I am so excited to be on this site with 2015 brides.  My fiance and I are getting married in Montego Bay on May 6th 2015.  I am looking forward with all of us helping each other with ideas.","Attachments":[],"Id":1818510,"PostDate":1386539554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies!! I am so excited to be on this site with 2015 brides.  My fiance and I are getting married in Montego Bay on May 6th 2015.  I am looking forward with all of us helping each other with ideas.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fmyers011586@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386519446,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"fmyers562015","Id":275537,"Name":"fmyers562015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77e16acd2740fd8e7612ddc6e7662f8b","RawContent":"Congrats 2015 brides we decided on July,4,2015 question when should I contact the resort??? We decided on the Dominican Republic, dreams la romana.","Attachments":[],"Id":1818660,"PostDate":1386625239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats 2015 brides we decided on July,4,2015 question when should I contact the resort??? We decided on the Dominican Republic, dreams la romana. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.103.56.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"826251c99a29fe06e21ab8cd4aec0be0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"crcombs\" post=\"1713106\" timestamp=\"1359494544\"]\nGood afternoon ladies! I will be a 2015 bride and I am so happy that I&#039;m not alone. I keep hearing why not next year but we are not ready right now. We decided last weekend to do a destination wedding in Cancun. This forum has helped so much with the details from everyone. I look forward to planning and hopefully helping someone else if I can.[\/quote]\nWhen you&#039;re not ready you&#039;re not ready. A wedding is an expense like anything else. Do it on your own time. My FI and I have been together 9 years and have an 8 month old and still aren&#039;t married! Until next year :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1819156,"PostDate":1386888576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>crcombs, on 29 January 2013 - 05:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Good afternoon ladies! I will be a 2015 bride and I am so happy that I'm not alone. I keep hearing why not next year but we are not ready right now. We decided last weekend to do a destination wedding in Cancun. This forum has helped so much with the details from everyone. I look forward to planning and hopefully helping someone else if I can.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When you're not ready you're not ready. A wedding is an expense like anything else. Do it on your own time. My FI and I have been together 9 years and have an 8 month old and still aren't married! Until next year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Now Jade Bride on November 21, 2014<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78208-amarie4713-now-jade-planning-thread\/?p=1875447'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78208-amarie4713-now-jade-planning-thread\/?p=1875447<\/a>","Email":"amarie.harder@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.103.56.157","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378918118,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"amarie4713","Id":273400,"Name":"amarie4713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6247ae7adc7d4cea17d8e77845c84bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m still waiting on the contract back from the hotel, but hoping to be a 1\/12\/15 bride at the Excellence Punta Cana.&amp;nbsp; SO EXCITED!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819450,"PostDate":1387206422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!!\u00a0 I'm still waiting on the contract back from the hotel, but hoping to be a 1\/12\/15 bride at the Excellence Punta Cana.\u00a0 SO EXCITED!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386889365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.255.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1387223741,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"461d10eac9e07f1de76187fe954ef378","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes - it&#039;s such an Exciting time for sure!!! and how awesome to have this much lead time to get your details just the way you want them - great start already......Enjoy your journey, and Congrats all!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Photography Is Forever Studios&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819526,"PostDate":1387223312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes - it's such an Exciting time for sure!!! and how awesome to have this much lead time to get your details just the way you want them - great start already......Enjoy your journey, and Congrats all!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Photography Is Forever Studios<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372797157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.138.178.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfe7f705b29398d3c8edc6773e64f56a","RawContent":"[quote]\nHello Ladies!!!\nIt is so comforting to see we are all pretty much on the sae page... I too just got engaged and I am looking into have a destination wedding... Im leading towards the domincan republic or aruba... Any suggestions???[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1819567,"PostDate":1387263107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\">\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hello Ladies!!!<\/p>\n<p>It is so comforting to see we are all pretty much on the sae page... I too just got engaged and I am looking into have a destination wedding... Im leading towards the domincan republic or aruba... Any suggestions???<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sfarias1985@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.138.178.150","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387262235,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"futuremrsgosselin","Id":275659,"Name":"futuremrsgosselin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8353dd356f453e76180f2ac19f74fe19","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kellisbaby\" post=\"1819450\" timestamp=\"1387220822\"]\nHi ladies!!  I&#039;m still waiting on the contract back from the hotel, but hoping to be a 1\/12\/15 bride at the Excellence Punta Cana.  SO EXCITED!![\/quote]\nSo excited for you!!! Have you been to punta Cana? You picked a great time to go because it&#039;s not too hot!!! May I ask how far in advance did you contact the resort???","Attachments":[],"Id":1819616,"PostDate":1387289129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kellisbaby, on 16 December 2013 - 03:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi ladies!!\u00a0 I'm still waiting on the contract back from the hotel, but hoping to be a 1\/12\/15 bride at the Excellence Punta Cana.\u00a0 SO EXCITED!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSo excited for you!!! Have you been to punta Cana? You picked a great time to go because it's not too hot!!! May I ask how far in advance did you contact the resort???\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d3adbe6e4fec1de74eaab7cd4cf3923","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"strwbsprkl\"]!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have never been to Punta Cana.&amp;nbsp; But have known friends who have gone and I&#039;ve heard great things about itt.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m dealing with a travel agent and we started contacting the resort for contract in early Dec (13 months in advance).&amp;nbsp; Not going to lie, it&#039;s been about two weeks and we (okay, the travel agent) is having to DRAG the room block out of them.&amp;nbsp; Hoping to finalize today.&amp;nbsp; Ugh, it&#039;s so stressful, I just want the contract stuff DONE so I can stop worrying about it and send the save-the-dates out.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819619,"PostDate":1387289356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272367\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272367-strwbsprkl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">strwbsprkl<\/span><\/a>!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have never been to Punta Cana.\u00a0 But have known friends who have gone and I've heard great things about itt.\u00a0 I'm dealing with a travel agent and we started contacting the resort for contract in early Dec (13 months in advance).\u00a0 Not going to lie, it's been about two weeks and we (okay, the travel agent) is having to DRAG the room block out of them.\u00a0 Hoping to finalize today.\u00a0 Ugh, it's so stressful, I just want the contract stuff DONE so I can stop worrying about it and send the save-the-dates out.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386889365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d1be2abab0425e9511ef032405c498f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kellisbaby\" post=\"1819619\" timestamp=\"1387303756\"]\nThanks @[member=\"strwbsprkl\"]!! \n \nI have never been to Punta Cana.  But have known friends who have gone and I&#039;ve heard great things about itt.  I&#039;m dealing with a travel agent and we started contacting the resort for contract in early Dec (13 months in advance).  Not going to lie, it&#039;s been about two weeks and we (okay, the travel agent) is having to DRAG the room block out of them.  Hoping to finalize today.  Ugh, it&#039;s so stressful, I just want the contract stuff DONE so I can stop worrying about it and send the save-the-dates out.[\/quote]Don&#039;t worry everything will plan out great!!! You will looooooove punta Cana! I went to a wedding there this august I decided on dreams La Romana. (Didn&#039;t want to look like a copy cat) lol. We are thinking of working with the resort directly hopefully that doesn&#039;t come back to bite us later on :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1819623,"PostDate":1387289796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kellisbaby, on 17 December 2013 - 02:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272367\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272367-strwbsprkl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">strwbsprkl<\/span><\/a>!!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI have never been to Punta Cana.\u00a0 But have known friends who have gone and I've heard great things about itt.\u00a0 I'm dealing with a travel agent and we started contacting the resort for contract in early Dec (13 months in advance).\u00a0 Not going to lie, it's been about two weeks and we (okay, the travel agent) is having to DRAG the room block out of them.\u00a0 Hoping to finalize today.\u00a0 Ugh, it's so stressful, I just want the contract stuff DONE so I can stop worrying about it and send the save-the-dates out.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDon't worry everything will plan out great!!! You will looooooove punta Cana! I went to a wedding there this august I decided on dreams La Romana. (Didn't want to look like a copy cat) lol. We are thinking of working with the resort directly hopefully that doesn't come back to bite us later on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
