{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a42fbb2080ed01f1fc3e6470fd6ea72","RawContent":"[quote name=\"strwbsprkl\" post=\"1819623\" timestamp=\"1387304196\"]\nDon&#039;t worry everything will plan out great!!! You will looooooove punta Cana! I went to a wedding there this august I decided on dreams La Romana. (Didn&#039;t want to look like a copy cat) lol. We are thinking of working with the resort directly hopefully that doesn&#039;t come back to bite us later on :([\/quote]\nI only went with a Travel Agent because I was kind of lazy.  I contacted my 1st choice hotel and they told me to do room blocks I&#039;d need a travel agent anyway.  The idea of outsourcing something was VERY appealing!! (We ended up deciding on our 2nd choice anyway.) It seems like there are lots of brides on here who do the room block themselves, or don&#039;t have a room block at all.\n\nYou are too sweet to not be a \"copy cat\".  I doubt your friend would have minded!!  :))  Isn&#039;t immitation the sincerest form of flattery?","Attachments":[],"Id":1819643,"PostDate":1387293220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>strwbsprkl, on 17 December 2013 - 02:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Don't worry everything will plan out great!!! You will looooooove punta Cana! I went to a wedding there this august I decided on dreams La Romana. (Didn't want to look like a copy cat) lol. We are thinking of working with the resort directly hopefully that doesn't come back to bite us later on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I only went with a Travel Agent because I was kind of lazy.\u00a0 I contacted my 1st choice hotel and they told me to do room blocks I'd need a travel agent anyway.\u00a0 The idea of outsourcing something was VERY appealing!! (We ended up deciding on our 2nd choice anyway.) It seems like there are lots of brides on here who do the room block themselves, or don't have a room block at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You are too sweet to not be a \"copy cat\".\u00a0 I doubt your friend would have minded!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>)\u00a0 Isn't immitation the sincerest form of flattery?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386889365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.255.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1387377880,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24c700fdcb8ef39f813a49ab509d4872","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;great thinking, brides, b\/c after all is said n done, it&#039;s all about Your Big Day and the two of you having the Wonderfully Amazing Wedding of your Dreams and life together&amp;nbsp;going forward - so Enjoy!!!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72454]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;team MTM :)&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819723,"PostDate":1387377691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>great thinking, brides, b\/c after all is said n done, it's all about Your Big Day and the two of you having the Wonderfully Amazing Wedding of your Dreams and life together\u00a0going forward - so Enjoy!!!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72454--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17458\/sml_gallery_30015_17458_1386232552_229523.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72454' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.171.88.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1baeee82bfa062d5c7b7a042d62b0636","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies I am getting married 4\/25\/15 at the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Jamaica.&amp;nbsp; I am so excited, I got engaged June 2013 and I knew immediately that I wanted a Destination Wedding.&amp;nbsp; I have a wonderful TA who helped me with deciding what resort and I can redirect all traveling questions from my guest to her which is Always a plus because who really has time for that when planning a wedding especially a DW.&amp;nbsp; Are there any brides who are somewhat a little flustered about the whole process?? I know I am overwhelmed a little.&amp;nbsp; I have paid the deposit for the wedding as well as the accommodations now photographer, videographer etc. O did I mention I am having a reception here LOL!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1820926,"PostDate":1388323642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies I am getting married 4\/25\/15 at the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Jamaica.\u00a0 I am so excited, I got engaged June 2013 and I knew immediately that I wanted a Destination Wedding.\u00a0 I have a wonderful TA who helped me with deciding what resort and I can redirect all traveling questions from my guest to her which is Always a plus because who really has time for that when planning a wedding especially a DW.\u00a0 Are there any brides who are somewhat a little flustered about the whole process?? I know I am overwhelmed a little.\u00a0 I have paid the deposit for the wedding as well as the accommodations now photographer, videographer etc. O did I mention I am having a reception here LOL!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~WesnKris<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"wesnkristogether@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.179.161.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384535310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275084.jpg?_r=1386562444","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WesnKris","Id":275084,"Name":"WesnKris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df3d8ad4819d8bb73441b030a8ec54b2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"WesnKris\" post=\"1820926\" timestamp=\"1388338042\"]\nHello Ladies I am getting married 4\/25\/15 at the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Jamaica.  I am so excited, I got engaged June 2013 and I knew immediately that I wanted a Destination Wedding.  I have a wonderful TA who helped me with deciding what resort and I can redirect all traveling questions from my guest to her which is Always a plus because who really has time for that when planning a wedding especially a DW.  Are there any brides who are somewhat a little flustered about the whole process?? I know I am overwhelmed a little.  I have paid the deposit for the wedding as well as the accommodations now photographer, videographer etc. O did I mention I am having a reception here LOL!![\/quote]\nWow congrats!!!!!!!!! You have a lot done!!!!!! I will be booking the resort in January for July 4 2015 I&#039;m so excited the have my spot reserved!!!!! Yay!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1821010,"PostDate":1388363687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>WesnKris, on 29 December 2013 - 01:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello Ladies I am getting married 4\/25\/15 at the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Jamaica.\u00a0 I am so excited, I got engaged June 2013 and I knew immediately that I wanted a Destination Wedding.\u00a0 I have a wonderful TA who helped me with deciding what resort and I can redirect all traveling questions from my guest to her which is Always a plus because who really has time for that when planning a wedding especially a DW.\u00a0 Are there any brides who are somewhat a little flustered about the whole process?? I know I am overwhelmed a little.\u00a0 I have paid the deposit for the wedding as well as the accommodations now photographer, videographer etc. O did I mention I am having a reception here LOL!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow congrats!!!!!!!!! You have a lot done!!!!!! I will be booking the resort in January for July 4 2015 I'm so excited the have my spot reserved!!!!! Yay!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.77.36.17","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff9ecac1f3d91b76a755334fcd81b615","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great job on your early starts, brides! sounds like you&#039;re off to a great start already - well done!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with the rest-o-it, have a Happy, Healthy, Loving and Abundant New Year - Cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72295]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72321]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72338]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72249]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:72323]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;from all of here at the Studios ....team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821147,"PostDate":1388427824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great job on your early starts, brides! sounds like you're off to a great start already - well done!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with the rest-o-it, have a Happy, Healthy, Loving and Abundant New Year - Cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72295--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17341\/sml_gallery_30015_17341_1386232538_229179.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72295' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72321--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17348\/sml_gallery_30015_17348_1386232542_229232.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72321' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72338--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17356\/sml_gallery_30015_17356_1386232543_229290.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72338' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72249--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17206\/sml_gallery_30015_17206_1386232532_229103.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72249' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/72323--\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17348\/sml_gallery_30015_17348_1386232542_229234.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='*\n'  width='200' height='134'  alt='*\n' id='sml_image_view_72323' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>from all of here at the Studios ....team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.171.88.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba4024023e10b71241c2e52d7976dc49","RawContent":"[quote name=\"strwbsprkl\" post=\"1821010\" timestamp=\"1388378087\"]\nWow congrats!!!!!!!!! You have a lot done!!!!!! I will be booking the resort in January for July 4 2015 I&#039;m so excited the have my spot reserved!!!!! Yay!!![\/quote]Thanks!!! Where are you having your wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":1821182,"PostDate":1388449405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>strwbsprkl, on 30 December 2013 - 12:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow congrats!!!!!!!!! You have a lot done!!!!!! I will be booking the resort in January for July 4 2015 I'm so excited the have my spot reserved!!!!! Yay!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks!!! Where are you having your wedding?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~WesnKris<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"wesnkristogether@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.179.161.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384535310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275084.jpg?_r=1386562444","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WesnKris","Id":275084,"Name":"WesnKris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.100.40.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32c7693de25161c9c5d4a9d0dad642bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was previously a 2014 bride but due to medical setbacks I am now a February 2015 bride. I am very excited to restart planning for my wedding. I am getting married in the Riveria Maya area in Mexico at Ocean Coral and Turquesa. Please add me as friend. I would like to share our experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821231,"PostDate":1388488152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was previously a 2014 bride but due to medical setbacks I am now a February 2015 bride. I am very excited to restart planning for my wedding. I am getting married in the Riveria Maya area in Mexico at Ocean Coral and Turquesa. Please add me as friend. I would like to share our experiences.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Tiarra <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">February 14th 2015 *A celebration of Love* <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Isla Mujeres<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"><em>\"And now abide faith, hope, love, these three; but the greatest of these <i>is<\/i> love.\"<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"tiarrajones0913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.92.9.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365416634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268317.jpg?_r=1387755717","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TiarraBeautyJ","Id":268317,"Name":"TiarraBeautyJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.57.85.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea35f4d17587ff506a21a122f6185a2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;All of you ladies are on the ball, now that the holiday season is over it&#039;s all out planning from here. &amp;nbsp;Getting married 8\/23\/14 and I&#039;ve been working on some things, but haven&#039;t gotten to the specifics yet! &amp;nbsp;Congrats on all of your engagements and happy planning! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821257,"PostDate":1388494291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>All of you ladies are on the ball, now that the holiday season is over it's all out planning from here. \u00a0Getting married 8\/23\/14 and I've been working on some things, but haven't gotten to the specifics yet! \u00a0Congrats on all of your engagements and happy planning! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kwolcott82314@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.57.85.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386879182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275606.jpg?_r=1386893736","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KWitt","Id":275606,"Name":"KWitt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23e60b50024551c0ab804c03e379e5ca","RawContent":"[quote name=\"WesnKris\" post=\"1821182\" timestamp=\"1388463805\"]\nThanks!!! Where are you having your wedding?[\/quote]my wedding will be in la romana dominican republic. im having a little issue now because my fiances brother got married in punta cana this past august and now his family doesn&#039;t seem that excited to go back to dr. Im so stressed and sad!!! now im dominican and i have family living over there that i want at my wedding. that the reason im sticking to dr. :(\n[quote name=\"KWitt\" post=\"1821257\" timestamp=\"1388508691\"]\nAll of you ladies are on the ball, now that the holiday season is over it&#039;s all out planning from here.  Getting married 8\/23\/14 and I&#039;ve been working on some things, but haven&#039;t gotten to the specifics yet!  Congrats on all of your engagements and happy planning![\/quote]yay that awesome you are almost there!!!!!!! how exciting are you doing a legal ceremony or symbolic?","Attachments":[],"Id":1821292,"PostDate":1388509267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>WesnKris, on 31 December 2013 - 12:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks!!! Where are you having your wedding?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>my wedding will be in la romana dominican republic. im having a little issue now because my fiances brother got married in punta cana this past august and now his family doesn't seem that excited to go back to dr. Im so stressed and sad!!! now im dominican and i have family living over there that i want at my wedding. that the reason im sticking to dr. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KWitt, on 31 December 2013 - 12:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>All of you ladies are on the ball, now that the holiday season is over it's all out planning from here. \u00a0Getting married 8\/23\/14 and I've been working on some things, but haven't gotten to the specifics yet! \u00a0Congrats on all of your engagements and happy planning! \u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>yay that awesome you are almost there!!!!!!! how exciting are you doing a legal ceremony or symbolic?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.171.88.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8510e3a206bb21036e4392ea4e607632","RawContent":"[quote name=\"strwbsprkl\" post=\"1821292\" timestamp=\"1388523667\"]\nmy wedding will be in la romana dominican republic. im having a little issue now because my fiances brother got married in punta cana this past august and now his family doesn&#039;t seem that excited to go back to dr. Im so stressed and sad!!! now im dominican and i have family living over there that i want at my wedding. that the reason im sticking to dr. :(\n\n[\/quote]\nI am sorry to hear that.  I am having issues with my in-laws wanting to go to Jamaica period, but you know at the end of the day I don&#039;t want 30 years later to look at my pictures of a wedding that was not what we wanted.\n[quote name=\"TiarraBeautyJ\" post=\"1821231\" timestamp=\"1388502552\"]\nHello Ladies,\n\nI was previously a 2014 bride but due to medical setbacks I am now a February 2015 bride. I am very excited to restart planning for my wedding. I am getting married in the Riveria Maya area in Mexico at Ocean Coral and Turquesa. Please add me as friend. I would like to share our experiences.[\/quote]I am glad that you are getting to plan the wedding of your dreams and the medical setbacks did not keep you down!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1821331,"PostDate":1388570431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>strwbsprkl, on 31 December 2013 - 05:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>my wedding will be in la romana dominican republic. im having a little issue now because my fiances brother got married in punta cana this past august and now his family doesn't seem that excited to go back to dr. Im so stressed and sad!!! now im dominican and i have family living over there that i want at my wedding. that the reason im sticking to dr. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am sorry to hear that.\u00a0 I am having issues with my in-laws wanting to go to Jamaica period, but you know at the end of the day I don't want 30 years later to look at my pictures of a wedding that was not what we wanted.<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TiarraBeautyJ, on 31 December 2013 - 11:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was previously a 2014 bride but due to medical setbacks I am now a February 2015 bride. I am very excited to restart planning for my wedding. I am getting married in the Riveria Maya area in Mexico at Ocean Coral and Turquesa. Please add me as friend. I would like to share our experiences.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I am glad that you are getting to plan the wedding of your dreams and the medical setbacks did not keep you down!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~WesnKris<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"wesnkristogether@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.179.161.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384535310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275084.jpg?_r=1386562444","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WesnKris","Id":275084,"Name":"WesnKris","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
