on vista print will be sending out save the date by end of June? What do you guys think lol :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1840019,"PostDate":1395647950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1840019]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272367-139566230625.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1395662306.432787.jpg -  103.14KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272367-139566230625.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1395662306.432787.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nPlaying around on vista print will be sending out save the date by end of June? What do you guys think lol <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.161.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6d4febd7995ef4446d97996685e74d8","RawContent":"I&#039;m Pi Day 2015 [3.14.15]  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1840284,"PostDate":1395697185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm Pi Day 2015 [3.14.15]  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.7.234.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d8986f04580dbfb1447211a6968913f","RawContent":"Were abouts u getting married@ marinah84? \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1840341,"PostDate":1395726728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Were abouts u getting married@ marinah84? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390383454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6637edcc88819a3d6c772ec251eb3ec7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Getting married 01\/07\/2015!!!! SO EXCITED!!! We&#039;ve booked the Gran Porto Real--anyone else looking at this resort???&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve been planning since October and have been anxious to get everything going!! The flights and resort just recently put up their prices so I booked!!! I&#039;m too anxious to wait for anything, so I HAD to get the ball rolling!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s what I have booked so far--&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;--resort-- We choose the Gran Master Oceanfront which gives us full access to the Royal across the street as this is their sister resort--adult only!! That way if we need to escape from our guests we can &amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;--Wedding package- We are unsure how many guests are attending so we opted for the Classisc Wedding package (they do offer a free one if you have a certain amount of rooms books for a certain amount of nights)... We are upgrading the semi private reception to a private beach reception ($15 pp) and are hiring a DJ for an additional $950.00 which offers a light up dance floor for $750.00--undecided on this still&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;--flight with seats reserved.. We chose to use Delta Vacation through our TA and they offer a $200 credit to guests and $50 for each ticket booked for the bride and groom.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;--photographer (Dean Sanderson&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/deansandersonweddings.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/deansandersonweddings.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/DeanSandersonWeddings&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/DeanSandersonWeddings&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;) check him out--his work is fantastic and him and his wife Anna have been a pleasure to work with and very helpful!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;--videographer ( Mike Cantrell&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/mikecantarellfilms.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/mikecantarellfilms.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; he offers two film styles and was referred by Dean and Anna--he has been very helpful and great to work with as well... Great thing is that Dean and him often do work together and will come to the resort as a team so there is only one outside vendor fee of $350.00&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wanted to share my information!! If there are any other 2015 Riviera Maya brides please share your experiences thus far!! I&#039;d love to be able to ask\/answer questions!!! &amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840662,"PostDate":1395837713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Getting married 01\/07\/2015!!!! SO EXCITED!!! We've booked the Gran Porto Real--anyone else looking at this resort???<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been planning since October and have been anxious to get everything going!! The flights and resort just recently put up their prices so I booked!!! I'm too anxious to wait for anything, so I HAD to get the ball rolling!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's what I have booked so far--<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>--resort-- We choose the Gran Master Oceanfront which gives us full access to the Royal across the street as this is their sister resort--adult only!! That way if we need to escape from our guests we can \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>--Wedding package- We are unsure how many guests are attending so we opted for the Classisc Wedding package (they do offer a free one if you have a certain amount of rooms books for a certain amount of nights)... We are upgrading the semi private reception to a private beach reception ($15 pp) and are hiring a DJ for an additional $950.00 which offers a light up dance floor for $750.00--undecided on this still<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>--flight with seats reserved.. We chose to use Delta Vacation through our TA and they offer a $200 credit to guests and $50 for each ticket booked for the bride and groom.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>--photographer (Dean Sanderson\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/deansandersonweddings.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/deansandersonweddings.com\/<\/a>\u00a0 or\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/DeanSandersonWeddings' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...ndersonWeddings<\/a>\u00a0) check him out--his work is fantastic and him and his wife Anna have been a pleasure to work with and very helpful!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>--videographer ( Mike Cantrell\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/mikecantarellfilms.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/mikecantarellfilms.com\/<\/a>\u00a0 he offers two film styles and was referred by Dean and Anna--he has been very helpful and great to work with as well... Great thing is that Dean and him often do work together and will come to the resort as a team so there is only one outside vendor fee of $350.00<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wanted to share my information!! If there are any other 2015 Riviera Maya brides please share your experiences thus far!! I'd love to be able to ask\/answer questions!!! \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99108e672285a334c806ef5b22168ec7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;@[member=\"Pablou\"] We have Booked the \"Pure\" collection for a beach ceremony at 6pm and are then hosting a cocktail hour on the beach and a 4 hour reception on the sky terrace. Still looking into DJ\/Flower\/Decoration options!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840796,"PostDate":1395913487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> We have Booked the \"Pure\" collection for a beach ceremony at 6pm and are then hosting a cocktail hour on the beach and a 4 hour reception on the sky terrace. Still looking into DJ\/Flower\/Decoration options!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391606556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":170,"NextPage":180,"PreviousPage":160,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
