{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.156.189.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"141e61a043309a0af9c1cf56cdc6fd93","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are also getting married in 2015... February 7th to be exact! We got engaged September 28, 2013. I&#039;m so relieved to have our resort, ceremony and reception location all locked down! We looked at so many resorts and it feels so good to get everything started.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning everyone! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848075,"PostDate":1399077607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also getting married in 2015... February 7th to be exact! We got engaged September 28, 2013. I'm so relieved to have our resort, ceremony and reception location all locked down! We looked at so many resorts and it feels so good to get everything started.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning everyone! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cara_278@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.89.170.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386101463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McGee2Be","Id":275472,"Name":"McGee2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc2439d31d57166f8ca7c94d70f8ee85","RawContent":"@[member=\"atyson03\"] I am also using bbv... Who&#039;s your ta?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1848076,"PostDate":1399081374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277535\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277535-atyson03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">atyson03<\/span><\/a> I am also using bbv... Who's your ta?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.230.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399148445,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f886d3bf974f1ed9805c114f896afca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations MvGee2Be&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul Sensitori is a beautiful hotel. Did you select one of the new memorable moments signature wedding collections?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I spent months photographing all of the new collections for the product marketing last year. Which location did you select ? Each one is wonderful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\t&amp;nbsp;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848136,"PostDate":1399147793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations MvGee2Be<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul Sensitori is a beautiful hotel. Did you select one of the new memorable moments signature wedding collections?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I spent months photographing all of the new collections for the product marketing last year. Which location did you select ? Each one is wonderful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t\u00a0\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vincent@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"200.79.230.62","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1396021412,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277385.jpg?_r=1412260548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VincentvandenBerg","Id":277385,"Name":"VincentvandenBerg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.156.189.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31c438d626057735e8a1f1c8ffa95fee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"VincentvandenBerg\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much! No unfortunately the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;memorable moments packages were out of our budget. If we could, we would have went for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;coastal&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;bliss package, although they are all gorgeous! You did a great job photographing those!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our ceremony location is Zocalo Beach, right near the pier. We were originally thinking of the sky terrace, but I have a friend in a wheelchair and I guess the elevator doesn&#039;t go all the way up. Plus I&#039;ve heard it gets quite windy. Looking forward to digging our toes in the sand! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848199,"PostDate":1399209769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277385\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277385-vincentvandenberg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VincentvandenBerg<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much! No unfortunately the\u00a0<span  style=\"font-size:14px\">memorable moments packages were out of our budget. If we could, we would have went for the\u00a0<\/span><span>coastal<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0bliss package, although they are all gorgeous! You did a great job photographing those!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>Our ceremony location is Zocalo Beach, right near the pier. We were originally thinking of the sky terrace, but I have a friend in a wheelchair and I guess the elevator doesn't go all the way up. Plus I've heard it gets quite windy. Looking forward to digging our toes in the sand! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cara_278@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.89.170.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386101463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McGee2Be","Id":275472,"Name":"McGee2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.253.164.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e630b18aec6df39f6bc15a514f875637","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"] I have Nan