FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78e07e4ecc39e7e3ac75c3e92b23e647","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"strwbsprkl\"] I did the same! Our date and location changed a ridiculous amount of times. We went from Costa Rica in February to Cancun in April! So when I finally got the confirmation I was screaming with excitement!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I almost called off the destination wedding so many times because it was to stressful picking a place i never been to, and trying to figure out what would be best for my guest. But i&#039;m standing behind me decision 100 % and couldn&#039;t be happier!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849667,"PostDate":1399817750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272367\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272367-strwbsprkl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">strwbsprkl<\/span><\/a> I did the same! Our date and location changed a ridiculous amount of times. We went from Costa Rica in February to Cancun in April! So when I finally got the confirmation I was screaming with excitement!\u00a0<\/p