om my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1851761,"PostDate":1400767362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay congrats!!!! 365 mark!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.102.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0be0ad61ddd2b9930c9cf325de71f51e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My name is Daniela and I am starting to plan my Punta Cana wedding for February 2015. I am so glad I have found this blog because there are sooo many options to choose from :unsure:&amp;nbsp;( I am still deciding on the venue between Excellence, Kukua and Jellyfish). I will try to help as much as I can with my info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;happy planning.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Daniela and Chris&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851805,"PostDate":1400783940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is Daniela and I am starting to plan my Punta Cana wedding for February 2015. I am so glad I have found this blog because there are sooo many options to choose from <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/>\u00a0( I am still deciding on the venue between Excellence, Kukua and Jellyfish). I will try to help as much as I can with my info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>happy planning.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Daniela and Chris<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielafranklin@outlook.com","IpAddress":"190.167.102.203","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400783057,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielaf","Id":278083,"Name":"danielaf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.148.35.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2fa4da1b03263b27816f1ae5977dfa7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m planning for a September 11, 2015 wedding in Cabo San Lucas, Mexico. I am seriously considering Sandos Finisterra Los Cabos resort with a sunset wedding on the beach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats to you all and happy planning!!!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851812,"PostDate":1400794432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm planning for a September 11, 2015 wedding in Cabo San Lucas, Mexico. I am seriously considering Sandos Finisterra Los Cabos resort with a sunset wedding on the beach.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to you all and happy planning!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10704;484\/st\/20150911\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/0c51\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"soulgroovy75@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.148.35.209","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400345858,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277999.jpg?_r=1431921321","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":205,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soulgroovy","Id":277999,"Name":"soulgroovy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.22.147","IsFirstPost":false,