I have just booked my wedding in Jamaica for April 2015 and would love to hear from other Jamaican brides :) x[\/quote]Where in Jamaica did you book @[member=\"paulah1984\"]\nI&#039;m currently looking at Jamaica right now... Still so undecided ...\n\nHow many guests?","Attachments":[],"Id":1852918,"PostDate":1401479272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>paulah1984, on 30 May 2014 - 05:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi I'm new to this site I have just booked my wedding in Jamaica for April 2015 and would love to hear from other Jamaican brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWhere in Jamaica did you book @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278172\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278172-paulah1984\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">paulah1984<\/span><\/a><br>\nI'm currently looking at Jamaica right now... Still so undecided ...<br><br>\nHow many guests? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397888214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03208b7eaac21986ca7cb25d5a3ca1d9","RawContent":"Hi we decided on the royalton white sands in montego bay, we get married the 2nd April 2015, we didn&#039;t really look at any other resorts we loved this one :) we only have a small party of 11 people travelling over with us so not many, we decided to go with the dream wedding package as it seems to include everything we need although we are paying extra for a private wedding reception on the beach, hope this helps x\nHi @[member=\"Kayla88\"] we decided to go with the royalton white sands, can&#039;t wait! Going dress shopping today :) x","Attachments":[],"Id":1852947,"PostDate":1401503196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi we decided on the royalton white sands in montego bay, we get married the 2nd April 2015, we didn't really look at any other resorts we loved this one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we only have a small party of 11 people travelling over with us so not many, we decided to go with the dream wedding package as it seems to include everything we need although we are paying extra for a private wedding reception on the beach, hope this helps x<br \/>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277780\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277780-kayla88\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kayla88<\/span><\/a> we decided to go with the royalton white sands, can't wait! Going dress shopping today <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"paula-1984@live.co.uk","IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401461892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278172.jpg?_r=1421157464","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulah1984","Id":278172,"Name":"paulah1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.208.76.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3227e75f44653f1683bcb39f22570b5d","RawContent":"I think I changed my mind 10 times about the resort. Initially I didn&#039;t even look at now jade bc my ideal date wasn&#039;t available but then it wasn&#039;t available anywhere even though other websites said it was so I revisited the website and just loved the rooms. This was more streasful then picking out my dress lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1853165,"PostDate":1401646616,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think I changed my mind 10 times about the resort. Initially I didn't even look at now jade bc my ideal date wasn't available but then it wasn't available anywhere even though other websites said it was so I revisited the website and just loved the rooms. This was more streasful then picking out my dress lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jamie","Email":"lovinmylilone@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.94.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400757982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nybride525","Id":278074,"Name":"Nybride525","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.124.208.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a59d3b264ed0ac9e2d7ec062551b1d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and happy wedding planning =0)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856123,"PostDate":1403175873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and happy wedding planning =0)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrystae@jwfloors.com","IpAddress":"67.124.208.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400763812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278076.jpg?_r=1423063276","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Chrysta","Id":278076,"Name":"Chrysta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c15e4d7f3b6c96fea295214ba3118e6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so happy I found this website, despite my background of wedding planning. &amp;nbsp;Planning a destination wedding is a different ordeal for sure! &amp;nbsp;We just set the date for May 29, 2015 at Excellence Rivera Cancun. &amp;nbsp;Although we have talked to most of the guests we were planning on sending an informal STD email followed up by a formal STD postcard in a few weeks. &amp;nbsp;That way I have time to get the website together and all the details for my guests to book their rooms. &amp;nbsp;We will probably send the formal invitations out 6-9 months out, depending on guest response.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning to all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857609,"PostDate":1404143573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so happy I found this website, despite my background of wedding planning. \u00a0Planning a destination wedding is a different ordeal for sure! \u00a0We just set the date for May 29, 2015 at Excellence Rivera Cancun. \u00a0Although we have talked to most of the guests we were planning on sending an informal STD email followed up by a formal STD postcard in a few weeks. \u00a0That way I have time to get the website together and all the details for my guests to book their rooms. \u00a0We will probably send the formal invitations out 6-9 months out, depending on guest response.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning to all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.250.80.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7762f7f0797e268d2ac82489fdbc7d21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just got engaged last month! November 2015 bride right here!! :) Hi Everyone!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858520,"PostDate":1404765007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just got engaged last month! November 2015 bride right here!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hi Everyone!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielle.march@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.250.80.76","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404763548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278883.jpg?_r=1404778194","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daniellemarch","Id":278883,"Name":"daniellemarch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.20.113.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6465980fbf5ac3ce1cae06388c06a9d6","RawContent":"Congrats!!!! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1858522,"PostDate":1404765982,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats!!!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","Join