{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de7906f655da3b241f32bee23b2abde7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hallo!!!! that i&#039;m late to say congratulation!!!!! the date is closed, are you feeling nervous or very excited? i am waiting your wedding picture. i newbie here, i need some advice.. but i&#039;m really really happy for you. Good luck!&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895218,"PostDate":1430651042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hallo!!!! that i'm late to say congratulation!!!!! the date is closed, are you feeling nervous or very excited? i am waiting your wedding picture. i newbie here, i need some advice.. but i'm really really happy for you. Good luck!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72192,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a4434cd2ed3e2c391a51455a652de43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know I went missing for a few months but, I was busy with the wedding and trying to make sure everything went ok. I have to say the wedding was absolutely amazing!!! We could not have asked for a better time. It was unforgettable and so many fun, loving memories that will last a lifetime. We had our wedding at the Gran Caribe Real on the beach and the reception on the rooftop. The hired DJ Doremixx and Ivan was the DJ. The photographer\/videographer was Octavio Montes and my wedding coordinator at the resort was Diana Rodriquez. Honestly words can&#039;t describe how everyone did a fantastic job. There was no stress, no worries and everything we asked for was done from beginning to end.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The staff at the Gran Caribe was attentive and friendly. They made sure our stay and our 76 guest were happy and comfortable.After a few days&amp;nbsp;they were calling us by our name. The bartendars knew what we wanted to drink as soon as we stepped up. I had read reviews and I&#039;m not sure what went wrong with the other brides but, I can assure you that I had no worries or concerns the 9 days we were there.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly, I could not have done this without using Wright Travel Agency. Virgilia and Wendy helped coordinate everything with the guest and the resort. They literally kept me sane and calm when I wanted to strangle some of the guest.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am not able to post pictures or video&#039;s on here so if anyone would like to see them or ask for more details please feel freed to email me &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:chalonda26@yahoo.com&#039;&gt;chalonda26@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning and good luck to future brides!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mrs. Christian :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MissFrench\"] How was the wedding?!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901788,"PostDate":1438676438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!!<\/p>\n<p>I know I went missing for a few months but, I was busy with the wedding and trying to make sure everything went ok. I have to say the wedding was absolutely amazing!!! We could not have asked for a better time. It was unforgettable and so many fun, loving memories that will last a lifetime. We had our wedding at the Gran Caribe Real on the beach and the reception on the rooftop. The hired DJ Doremixx and Ivan was the DJ. The photographer\/videographer was Octavio Montes and my wedding coordinator at the resort was Diana Rodriquez. Honestly words can't describe how everyone did a fantastic job. There was no stress, no worries and everything we asked for was done from beginning to end.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The staff at the Gran Caribe was attentive and friendly. They made sure our stay and our 76 guest were happy and comfortable.After a few days\u00a0they were calling us by our name. The bartendars knew what we wanted to drink as soon as we stepped up. I had read reviews and I'm not sure what went wrong with the other brides but, I can assure you that I had no worries or concerns the 9 days we were there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, I could not have done this without using Wright Travel Agency. Virgilia and Wendy helped coordinate everything with the guest and the resort. They literally kept me sane and calm when I wanted to strangle some of the guest.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am not able to post pictures or video's on here so if anyone would like to see them or ask for more details please feel freed to email me <a href='mailto:chalonda26@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>chalonda26@yahoo.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning and good luck to future brides!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,<\/p>\n<p>Mrs. Christian <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280992\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280992-missfrench\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissFrench<\/span><\/a> How was the wedding?!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chalonda26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359479090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpg?_r=1438712626","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"crcombs","Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":272,"TotalPages":28,"CurrentPage":270,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":260,"LastPage":270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
