{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa0fb99b53e88a185e01555b3597ea04","RawContent":"we did!!\n he found my profile on facebook.com and liked what he saw so he messaged me. we talked through facebook messages, then msn for a few weeks before going on our first date. 1 year later we got engaged and i couldn&#039;t be happier","Attachments":[],"Id":474887,"PostDate":1223420279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we did!!<br \/> he found my profile on facebook.com and liked what he saw so he messaged me. we talked through facebook messages, then msn for a few weeks before going on our first date. 1 year later we got engaged and i couldn't be happier\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>nyssa & joel<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/calchiks-punta-cana-gran-bahia-prinicipe-bavaro-wedding-review-long-pics-45227\/\"><strong>Our Punta Cana wedding review<\/strong><\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/s384.photobucket.com\/albums\/oo290\/njadem\/wedding\/photo%20book\/?albumview=slideshow\"><strong>Our photo book<\/strong><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"joelnyssa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1214506511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210179.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calchik","Id":210179,"Name":"calchik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cc1171be33aa7e3916924b3e86d852a","RawContent":"We didn&#039;t meet online, I happened to be in town visiting a friend of his and we all ended up going out to dinner; but since we were in different states, we corresponded via Myspace and AIM in the early parts of our relationship before we were officially a &amp;quot;couple.&amp;quot; :)","Attachments":[],"Id":474932,"PostDate":1223424404,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We didn't meet online, I happened to be in town visiting a friend of his and we all ended up going out to dinner; but since we were in different states, we corresponded via Myspace and AIM in the early parts of our relationship before we were officially a \"couple.\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i35.tinypic.com\/1076iaf.jpg\">http:\/\/i35.tinypic.com\/1076iaf.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1202\/1007\/20090919\/Our+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1202\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/foxybrides-extremely-detailed-las-vegas-wedding-review-49821\/\">FoxyBride's Las Vegas Wedding Review Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/foxybrides-past-due-planning-thread-49781\/\">FoxyBride's Las Vegas Planning Thread<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alfox@umich.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1221371100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211713.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FoxyBride","Id":211713,"Name":"FoxyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5cffd76202102772a883d248f63c582","RawContent":"We did too! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n I love reading all these happy stories &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/popcorn.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Popcorn\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n We were both on Plenty of Fish (free site). I&#039;d been on it about 6 months and only gone on a few crappy dates, but had finally met a guy I liked in September. By November, that army guy and I were meeting up (it was long-distance) and liked eachother. I had put FI&#039;s profile in my favorites, because it was so cute. \n His profile was from his (now our) dog&#039;s perspective. It was so cute and funny. About what kind of girl he would look for for his owner. His name was owner of a spoiled dog. I don&#039;t even think his photo was up initially.\n \n Anyway, in November, FI emailed me, but I was with army dude. I wrote back because he sounded so genuine and sweet. I told him what was going on and that I was sorry, but dating someone else. \n Then in December, he saw me at the grocery store, but didn&#039;t introduce himself.\n \n After Christmas, army dude ended up being army jerk, so I was kind of sick of dating. I went online to delete my profile in April having not used the service since September. FI&#039;s profile popped up on the screen with all the others and I recognized it immediately. I shot him off an email really quickly saying I remembered him and wondered how he was and that I was going offline and gave him my email address.\n \n He emailed back, we had one bad first date on July 29th, one hilarious second date and after the third date the following week and the rest is history! I moved in with him in October and we got engaged in March. \n \n He is absolutely perfect for me. We are so happy that we found eachother. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":475005,"PostDate":1223429726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We did too! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> I love reading all these happy stories <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/popcorn.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Popcorn\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We were both on Plenty of Fish (free site). I'd been on it about 6 months and only gone on a few crappy dates, but had finally met a guy I liked in September. By November, that army guy and I were meeting up (it was long-distance) and liked eachother. I had put FI's profile in my favorites, because it was so cute. <br \/> His profile was from his (now our) dog's perspective. It was so cute and funny. About what kind of girl he would look for for his owner. His name was owner of a spoiled dog. I don't even think his photo was up initially.<br \/> <br \/> Anyway, in November, FI emailed me, but I was with army dude. I wrote back because he sounded so genuine and sweet. I told him what was going on and that I was sorry, but dating someone else. <br \/> Then in December, he saw me at the grocery store, but didn't introduce himself.<br \/> <br \/> After Christmas, army dude ended up being army jerk, so I was kind of sick of dating. I went online to delete my profile in April having not used the service since September. FI's profile popped up on the screen with all the others and I recognized it immediately. I shot him off an email really quickly saying I remembered him and wondered how he was and that I was going offline and gave him my email address.<br \/> <br \/> He emailed back, we had one bad first date on July 29th, one hilarious second date and after the third date the following week and the rest is history! I moved in with him in October and we got engaged in March. <br \/> <br \/> He is absolutely perfect for me. We are so happy that we found eachother. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/a1o1kkp8fxm.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/a1o1kkp8fxm.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/women.evenhealth.com\/image\/c\/bg1029919.jpg\">http:\/\/women.evenhealth.com\/image\/c\/bg1029919.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"asraynor@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208628123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209143.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kevsgirl","Id":209143,"Name":"kevsgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0babdb60716110c0c87f1b7f599959","RawContent":"Ryan and I met online as well. We met on plentyoffish.com, actually only talked a cpl times for a few hours each before we met. But that was because I was going to a wedding about 45 mins away from where he lived at the time, so I stopped in to where he was working for dinner on my way to the wedding to quickly say hi. After that, we were hooked, texting each other all weekend and meeting again on my way home. A month later he moved closer to me, and soon after that, in with me.","Attachments":[],"Id":489232,"PostDate":1224872974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ryan and I met online as well. We met on plentyoffish.com, actually only talked a cpl times for a few hours each before we met. But that was because I was going to a wedding about 45 mins away from where he lived at the time, so I stopped in to where he was working for dinner on my way to the wedding to quickly say hi. After that, we were hooked, texting each other all weekend and meeting again on my way home. A month later he moved closer to me, and soon after that, in with me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hara16@telus.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1224799374,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212378.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lizzie287","Id":212378,"Name":"lizzie287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17024b1a52cbb5c39e9c92a1792bd67a","RawContent":"We initially met online, through Myspace. I can&#039;t remember the exact situation. I think I was browsing a friend&#039;s profile and came across FI&#039;s. I complimented him on his photography, since we both photographed weddings. I thought he was really awesome, but wasn&#039;t really looking for anyone. For three months straight I was trying to hook him up with the owner of the dance studio I taught at... and she wasn&#039;t interested. Then there was a large convention in town that I was speaking and performing at, and he was shooting. We met in person at the pre-party for the first time, hung out the entire weekend, and the rest is history!","Attachments":[],"Id":489265,"PostDate":1224874569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We initially met online, through Myspace. I can't remember the exact situation. I think I was browsing a friend's profile and came across FI's. I complimented him on his photography, since we both photographed weddings. I thought he was really awesome, but wasn't really looking for anyone. For three months straight I was trying to hook him up with the owner of the dance studio I taught at... and she wasn't interested. Then there was a large convention in town that I was speaking and performing at, and he was shooting. We met in person at the pre-party for the first time, hung out the entire weekend, and the rest is history!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"reddiamond@email.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1210728480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209394.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":92,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RedDiamond","Id":209394,"Name":"RedDiamond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76143a2e46aa2c4f6dd74ccd3954a7b1","RawContent":"Yes we meet online. On yahoo personals. I was so frustrated with the whole process that I had decided I was going to contact this one person and if he did not reply I was going to stop looking. I had gone on some pretty bad dates and I was getting so stressed out over the whole online dating scene. Well it took him 3 weeks to reply. I had given up and was going in that day to delete my profile. He also was about to delete his profile when he noticed that I had contacted him. We chatted a few nights on msn, then a few nights on the phone and meet in person for dinner and a movie and we have been together eversince. We are planning a beach wedding in Punta Cana on our 5 year anniversary of meeting in person Dec 1.\n \n Chris","Attachments":[],"Id":489383,"PostDate":1224880854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes we meet online. On yahoo personals. I was so frustrated with the whole process that I had decided I was going to contact this one person and if he did not reply I was going to stop looking. I had gone on some pretty bad dates and I was getting so stressed out over the whole online dating scene. Well it took him 3 weeks to reply. I had given up and was going in that day to delete my profile. He also was about to delete his profile when he noticed that I had contacted him. We chatted a few nights on msn, then a few nights on the phone and meet in person for dinner and a movie and we have been together eversince. We are planning a beach wedding in Punta Cana on our 5 year anniversary of meeting in person Dec 1.<br \/> <br \/> Chris\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>July 8, 2011, Couples Sans Souci Ocho Rios, Jamaica<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chriswin441@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1224276089,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212304.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunstarsmoon","Id":212304,"Name":"sunstarsmoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57316fe454ec2acce87f18285ca6a31f","RawContent":"We met online too. But it might be a little bit odd comparing to a lot of you. \n \n We met via ICQ&#039;s white page where you can set some sort of search criterias. I was doing a random search in local area for some new friends to chat, and bump into him. It worked out pretty well for us. \n \n Man, it&#039;s 9 years ago! Our story still amazed many friends~","Attachments":[],"Id":491486,"PostDate":1225123160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We met online too. But it might be a little bit odd comparing to a lot of you. <br \/> <br \/> We met via ICQ's white page where you can set some sort of search criterias. I was doing a random search in local area for some new friends to chat, and bump into him. It worked out pretty well for us. <br \/> <br \/> Man, it's 9 years ago! Our story still amazed many friends~\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>My lovely baby - Sam<\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i291.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll281\/samchu_photo\/IMG_0172-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i291.photobucket.com\/albums\/l...IMG_0172-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"pegyegirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1209584854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209234.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bbpacco","Id":209234,"Name":"bbpacco","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1d5b276a2c35aeea0a7cfda0876f6b0","RawContent":"Yes, my fiancee and I met on eharmony!","Attachments":[],"Id":491496,"PostDate":1225123785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes, my fiancee and I met on eharmony!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlj1176@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212523879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209739.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jlj1176","Id":209739,"Name":"jlj1176","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ac4702eeca08fc2c9f98ec72ec0036f","RawContent":"i was always skeptical about meeting someone on-line...or even at church (because my dad went to church just to find a woman:) but im a skeptic about EVERYTHING! one reason i didnt try online match sites was because i didnt trust myself to pick a good man, i wanted to leave it in Gods hands to deliver the fellow in some mystical, magical way:) sooo, i ended up meeting him at work and turns out we went to the same church out of ALL of the churches in San Diego but we never saw eachother at church until after we met at work. so that was one way for me to see God&#039;s fingerprint on the one He chose for me. i have to be honest though! everytime i get annoyed with my &amp;quot;God sent&amp;quot;, i always wonder what it would have been like to of been able to meet someone based on all of their interests and looks ect. (not that my husband isnt HOT!:) like you can online but im finding as time goes by, we change so much anyway, it probably wouldnt matter.","Attachments":[],"Id":491561,"PostDate":1225127473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i was always skeptical about meeting someone on-line...or even at church (because my dad went to church just to find a woman:) but im a skeptic about EVERYTHING! one reason i didnt try online match sites was because i didnt trust myself to pick a good man, i wanted to leave it in Gods hands to deliver the fellow in some mystical, magical way:) sooo, i ended up meeting him at work and turns out we went to the same church out of ALL of the churches in San Diego but we never saw eachother at church until after we met at work. so that was one way for me to see God's fingerprint on the one He chose for me. i have to be honest though! everytime i get annoyed with my \"God sent\", i always wonder what it would have been like to of been able to meet someone based on all of their interests and looks ect. (not that my husband isnt HOT!<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> like you can online but im finding as time goes by, we change so much anyway, it probably wouldnt matter.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"photographybyKRISTIE@HOTMAIL.COm","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1204066020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208665.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristie O","Id":208665,"Name":"Kristie O","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4da04df713048a1cf47d5d922d14d95","RawContent":"We also met online! For us it was plentyoffish. I&#039;d met a few guys before him and wasn&#039;t impressed....but as soon as Kirk and I met, we were inseperable! \n \n ...He&#039;s lucky I forgave him for cancelling what was supposed to be our first date and gave him a second chance! :) (ok, ok, I&#039;m lucky as well)","Attachments":[],"Id":511909,"PostDate":1226978748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We also met online! For us it was plentyoffish. I'd met a few guys before him and wasn't impressed....but as soon as Kirk and I met, we were inseperable! <br \/> <br \/> ...He's lucky I forgave him for cancelling what was supposed to be our first date and gave him a second chance! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> (ok, ok, I'm lucky as well)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sylvie_brunet_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226940630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212713.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lucky_Girl","Id":212713,"Name":"Lucky_Girl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":240,"TotalPages":24,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
