{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b01079f88b317904cceea36fda8c896b","RawContent":"We did - match.com in 2004! I have no problems in telling people how we met - I think it is a fantastic alternative for those of us who eitheri don&#039;t want to date someone they work with or do not go out much. I had just moved to a new city (San Antonio) and didn&#039;t know anyone...and so I tried match.com - and it worked :)","Attachments":[],"Id":521374,"PostDate":1227868257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We did - match.com in 2004! I have no problems in telling people how we met - I think it is a fantastic alternative for those of us who eitheri don't want to date someone they work with or do not go out much. I had just moved to a new city (San Antonio) and didn't know anyone...and so I tried match.com - and it worked <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10704;116\/st\/20081209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/60b5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...60b5\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><strong>Tracy<\/strong><strong>39 Guests Booked!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracy_hawley@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1213284384,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209918.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tracy","Id":209918,"Name":"Tracy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cda1f8e82e1ad1161e163ebcf2edcaf2","RawContent":"We met through Hi5 (kind of like Facebook) in 2004. We weren&#039;t looking for relationships because he lived on the West Coast and I lived on the other end of the county. We spent 7 months chatting until my family invited him out as a Christmas surprise. It worked out really well and we clicked. We continued our long distance relationship for 8 months before I moved in with him over on the West Coast...and here we are getting married in 2 months.\n \n PS: Tracy you&#039;re getting married in 10 days! Wow that&#039;s soon. Have fun and best wishes!","Attachments":[],"Id":522057,"PostDate":1227980622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We met through Hi5 (kind of like Facebook) in 2004. We weren't looking for relationships because he lived on the West Coast and I lived on the other end of the county. We spent 7 months chatting until my family invited him out as a Christmas surprise. It worked out really well and we clicked. We continued our long distance relationship for 8 months before I moved in with him over on the West Coast...and here we are getting married in 2 months.<br \/> <br \/> PS: Tracy you're getting married in 10 days! Wow that's soon. Have fun and best wishes!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ftp8v1y2pikir.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ftp8v1y2pikir.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chantal_duchesne@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206512200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208924.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":76,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantal85","Id":208924,"Name":"Chantal85","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":240,"TotalPages":24,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
