to break up with. finally my FI was so wonderful and i saw the light haha. he asked me to move in last may and proposed in november 07.","Attachments":[],"Id":223867,"PostDate":1205203704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                technically, we were together for 8 months before he proposed. however, we were best friends in grad school since 2005, and started casually seeing each other as more than friends but not quite boyfriend\/girlfriend status in the fall of 2006, because i was still seeing someone else who i just didnt have the balls to break up with. finally my FI was so wonderful and i saw the light haha. he asked me to move in last may and proposed in november 07.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mwall.hernandez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.179.124.226","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1192199700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207843.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Maura","Id":207843,"Name":"Maura","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":875,"TotalPages":88,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
