,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We dated for 3 years, have been engaged for 1.5 years so far, and will have another 2-3 years before we actually walk down the aisle (for a total of 3-4.5 years of engagement)...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcl@marialeinen.com","IpAddress":"96.226.115.75","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1170101580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207113.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":79,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MikkiStreak","Id":207113,"Name":"MikkiStreak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15a7c2c576e2112a14f0b8af9574320f","RawContent":"We&#039;ve been together for over 6 years, living together for 5.\n \n We&#039;ll have been together for over 7 years when we get married.\n \n Like my mom said, &amp;quot;it&#039;s about time you got engaged&amp;quot; LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":223966,"PostDate":1205212555,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We've been together for over 6 years, living together for 5.<br \/> <br \/> We'll have been together for over 7 years when we get married.<br \/> <br \/> Like my mom said, \"it's about time you got engaged\" LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i298.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm243\/sorcha_o\/bdwsiggy3-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i298.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...dwsiggy3-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signature\/de7ea272d572ce3e.gif\">http:\/\/www.whenismywedding.com\/signa...72d572ce3e.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sorcha_o@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204740720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208731.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":87,"PhotoHeight":83,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"townie princess","Id":208731,"Name":"townie princess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"540f6a529dfaa58ede3e769df6b2489c","RawContent":"We started dating in 1999 in April. I told him on one of our first dates that we were going to get married. Maybe that is why it took so long to ask me! I scared him!.\n We moved in together in 2001 and are getting married in May. By the time we get married, we will have been together over 9 years! My lil sis is 20 so I tell them both that he has been in her life for almost half of it!","Attachments":[],"Id":224004,"PostDate":1205230768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We started dating in 1999 in April. I told him on one of our first dates that we were going to get married. Maybe that is why it took so long to ask me! I scared him!.<br \/> We moved in together in 2001 and are getting married in May. By the time we get married, we will have been together over 9 years! My lil sis is 20 so I tell them both that he has been in her life for almost half of it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My favorite type of vacation, a relaxing one!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;53;87\/st\/20080512\/e\/Our+wedding%21\/k\/d7b2\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...d7b2\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"albrosious@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1195266473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207943.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":68,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandalovesryan","Id":207943,"Name":"amandalovesryan","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":875,"TotalPages":88,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
