:false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8e208a7bd5005ed5ac5b702692ea0b0","RawContent":"Dated for 8.5 years before getting engaged. Will get married one month shy of our 10 year anniversary....do I win?","Attachments":[],"Id":225841,"PostDate":1205350053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Dated for 8.5 years before getting engaged. Will get married one month shy of our 10 year anniversary....do I win?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Hawaiian Bride (formely Cabo - A)<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"agarcia@amocofcu.org","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204146969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208675.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cabo - A","Id":208675,"Name":"Cabo - A","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cef1526685ab3bc1bc63aac1339c982","RawContent":"We were engaged after 5 1\/5 months of dating.\n And now a fairly short engagement.... we will be saying &amp;quot;i do&amp;quot; after 14 months of knowing each other. \n I think we knew after a month that we would end up getting married... but people would have really thought we were crazy if we would have told them that!! LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":225926,"PostDate":1205354443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were engaged after 5 1\/5 months of dating.<br \/> And now a fairly short engagement.... we will be saying \"i do\" after 14 months of knowing each other. <br \/> I think we knew after a month that we would end up getting married... but people would have really thought we were crazy if we would have told them that!! LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20080708\/e\/Wedding+day%21%21%21%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/e68c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e68c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"holly@bradandhollyincabo.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1203987889,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208651.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cabobridey","Id":208651,"Name":"cabobridey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f07423994c6f61be8929e64bc605f751","RawContent":"wow im a short one he proposed after a year!","Attachments":[],"Id":225928,"PostDate":1205354503,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                wow im a short one he proposed after a year!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tlomlad@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1196044020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207977.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tlomlad","Id":207977,"Name":"tlomlad","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5102d5621ffd694bf6e3dc62dd32f510","RawContent":"I win shortest-dating-to engaged-award. We dated for 2 months before he proposed, and we&#039;re getting married 5 months after that! In all fairness, we were best friends for the last 4 years, and we actually went to the same high school, but we had never even hinted at dating until October 2007, one week after things ended with the last guy (short relationship) I was with. For us, the only next step in our relationship was to decide to get married, so here we are, 2 months away!","Attachments":[],"Id":225976,"PostDate":1205355431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I win shortest-dating-to engaged-award. We dated for 2 months before he proposed, and we're getting married 5 months after that! In all fairness, we were best friends for the last 4 years, and we actually went to the same high school, but we had never even hinted at dating until October 2007, one week after things ended with the last guy (short relationship) I was with. For us, the only next step in our relationship was to decide to get married, so here we are, 2 months away!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandysuzanne@juno.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201386647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208376.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mandy","Id":208376,"Name":"Mandy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"467d00a67ead5a333ffebc5b1f1eeadb","RawContent":"We were dating about 4 years when we got married - but I knew him for closer to 6 or so.","Attachments":[],"Id":225996,"PostDate":1205356288,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were dating about 4 years when we got married - but I knew him for closer to 6 or so.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b887770af5b7d382e72678ec817ced8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Mandy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I win shortest-dating-to engaged-award. We dated for 2 months before he proposed, and we&#039;re getting married 5 months after that! In all fairness, we were best friends for the last 4 years, and we actually went to the same high school, but we had never even hinted at dating until October 2007, one week after things ended with the last guy (short relationship) I was with. For us, the only next step in our relationship was to decide to get married, so here we are, 2 months away!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;mandy we mustve been friends in another lifetime or something because sometimes the similarities in our lives creep me out haha\n \n we knew after 2 months of dating we wanted to get married, although he didnt propose until we were together for what like 8 months, and we were best friends for the 2 years before that but i was dating someone else.","Attachments":[],"Id":226056,"PostDate":1205359083,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Mandy<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I win shortest-dating-to engaged-award. We dated for 2 months before he proposed, and we're getting married 5 months after that! In all fairness, we were best friends for the last 4 years, and we actually went to the same high school, but we had never even hinted at dating until October 2007, one week after things ended with the last guy (short relationship) I was with. For us, the only next step in our relationship was to decide to get married, so here we are, 2 months away!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>mandy we mustve been friends in another lifetime or something because sometimes the similarities in our lives creep me out haha<br \/> <br \/> we knew after 2 months of dating we wanted to get married, although he didnt propose until we were together for what like 8 months, and we were best friends for the 2 years before that but i was dating someone else.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mwall.hernandez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.179.124.226","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1192199700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207843.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Maura","Id":207843,"Name":"Maura","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49967551d6796d860e8e0cf88c520f82","RawContent":"After 3 years we got engaged, but it was taken us 4 years since our engagment to get married. By the time we get married in June, we will have been together for almost 8 years total in August.","Attachments":[],"Id":226064,"PostDate":1205359449,"PostC