n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We met in late 2002 and dated casually for about a year and a half... Then dated seriously for another four years before getting engaged in January 08.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"petinadixon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1205359361,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208796.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~*petals*~","Id":208796,"Name":"~*petals*~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"887106412bc6ae1f6f93e84b15ef3746","RawContent":"We&#039;d been together almost 3 years when we got engaged. We&#039;ll have been together about three and a half years on our wedding day.","Attachments":[],"Id":236641,"PostDate":1206139798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We'd been together almost 3 years when we got engaged. We'll have been together about three and a half years on our wedding day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh9\/sherrywendt\/Wedding%20Pro%20Pics\/Wedding%20Pro%20PIcs%20%20Faves\/173-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i252.photobucket.com\/albums\/h...aves\/173-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/maui-pro-pics-30724\/\">My Pro Wedding Pics<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/sherrys-maui-wedding-review-33306\/\">My Wedding Review<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sherrywendt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.140.86","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204516486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208704.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sherry","Id":208704,"Name":"Sherry","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd6b2e92edf51864763ec6e7410cb1cb","RawContent":"It&#039;s kind of cool to see that so many people who &amp;quot;waited&amp;quot; longer are doing the destination wedding. People have bugged us for years, and it just made us want to do it this way even more.\n \n Anyhow, were together 6 years and 2 months before engagement, by the time of the wedding it will be 71\/2 years.\n \n There was never any doubt. We waited because I was in school and we wanted our finances in order to have the wedding of our dreams!","Attachments":[],"Id":237083,"PostDate":1206169999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It's kind of cool to see that so many people who \"waited\" longer are doing the destination wedding. People have bugged us for years, and it just made us want to do it this way even more.<br \/> <br \/> Anyhow, were together 6 years and 2 months before engagement, by the time of the wedding it will be 71\/2 years.<br \/> <br \/> There was never any doubt. We waited because I was in school and we wanted our finances in order to have the wedding of our dreams!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Colin in I in 2005 when we fell in love with Maui!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennifer.matte@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206049639,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pisces","Id":208870,"Name":"Pisces","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0585159229d57f99817b1be011731e9","RawContent":"We were together just over 5 1\/2 years before we got engaged, and will be together just over 6 years when we get married. I admit that I was incredibly impatient and antsy - I&#039;ve known for about 10 years that I was going to marry him!","Attachments":[],"Id":237106,"PostDate":1206188114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were together just over 5 1\/2 years before we got engaged, and will be together just over 6 years when we get married. I admit that I was incredibly impatient and antsy - I've known for about 10 years that I was going to marry him!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><br>Amanda<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amandasteffens@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1205888514,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208849.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmandaR","Id":208849,"Name":"AmandaR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ae6c1f6c86d1251bf5f7659d167295c","RawContent":"We were together for 4 and half years when we got enaged. It will be five years right after our wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":237117,"PostDate":1206189041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                