                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Dbld78<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I beat you all....10 years!<br \/> <br \/> It will almost be 11 by the time we're married. We've been together since freshman year of college!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>You sound like you got us beat by a few months!-- It was 10 years in Sept-- and we are getting married in May-- so a little over 10 1\/2 when we'll be married! --- we did break up twice- 6-7 months each time-- so I'm not sure if that factors in -hehe...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;128\/st\/20080516\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/cd22\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...cd22\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannon.sparks@fmr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1191732320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207824.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shannon","Id":207824,"Name":"shannon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb0648f0654900bf883c16ff06710c78","RawContent":"For us, together 5 yrs before we got engaged and it will be 7 yrs by the time the wedding rolls aroun in April &#039;09.","Attachments":[],"Id":249884,"PostDate":1207097426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For us, together 5 yrs before we got engaged and it will be 7 yrs by the time the wedding rolls aroun in April '09.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20090424\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Paradise\/dt\/1\/k\/4d17\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4d17\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"breen_michelle@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1197813306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208036.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shellb","Id":208036,"Name":"shellb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70b949100586c5792efbfac917077d4d","RawContent":"Engaged shortly before our &amp;quot;official&amp;quot; one year anniversary but a little over a year since we met. Not exactly being spring chickens and the both of us wanting to have little chickletts in the near future probably sped up the getting to know you timeline (I&#039;m 33, he&#039;s 36). \n \n We moved in together about a week before the engagement even though I said I&#039;d never live with someone before the commitment was made (haven&#039;t lived with a b\/f in over 10 years), I think he popped the question as his big step since I was willing to take mine! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":250016,"PostDate":1207101543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Engaged shortly before our \"official\" one year anniversary but a little over a year since we met. Not exactly being spring chickens and the both of us wanting to have little chickletts in the near future probably sped up the getting to know you timeline (I'm 33, he's 36). <br \/> <br \/> We moved in together about a week before the engagement even though I said I'd never live with someone before the commitment was made (haven't lived with a b\/f in over 10 years), I think he popped the question as his big step since I was willing to take mine! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><