ied. I thought that was a long time, but apparently there is some stiff competition out there!","Attachments":[],"Id":298163,"PostDate":1210348000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We dated for 8 1\/2 years when we got engaged and had been living together for 1 year, and we will have been together for 9 1\/2 years when we get married. I thought that was a long time, but apparently there is some stiff competition out there!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Lindsay and Jamie - January 28, 2009<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lindsay_a_West@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1207537738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209032.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"seaprincess","Id":209032,"Name":"seaprincess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad4d96b64a84cb05b35e23977ccf7ff3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;vale&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I think I have that title, we&#039;ve been together for 20 (nearly 21), living together for 18 &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I dont feel so bad now 17 dating living together 1 1\/2&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile35\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile41.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile41\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":298170,"PostDate":1210348303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>vale<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I think I have that title, we've been together for 20 (nearly 21), living together for 18 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I dont feel so bad now 17 dating living together 1 1\/2<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile35\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile41.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile41\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nurturedbynature312@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1173470820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207248.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyP","Id":207248,"Name":"LadyP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"faa9398059e12fc8fdda1c78fd2684f3","RawContent":"FI started having the ring made after we were dating for 11 months. He got down on one knee 13 months after our first date and we will be married 2 1\/2 years after our first date. I never wanted to be married until I met him and our relationship is so easy we knew within 6 months we would marry each other. We were in no hurry and the proposal was a surprise.","Attachments":[],"Id":301673,"PostDate":1210695657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                