years by the time we are married in February 2009!! It will feel weird to start the count over again!","Attachments":[],"Id":372146,"PostDate":1215527200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We will have dated for 13 years by the time we are married in February 2009!! It will feel weird to start the count over again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreajphillips@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.10.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1213805820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Banana11","Id":210029,"Name":"Banana11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a5e306f4f8d6c4f707ffec4f6d5dafb","RawContent":"We dated for 4 months before we got engaged. I was SO surprised - we had talked about marriage very early on but I thought we would be like most &amp;quot;normal&amp;quot; couples and date for at least a year. When you know, you know!\n \n We were introduced to each other 2 years before we started dating - we lived half way across the country from each other and even though we hit it off almost immediately, it wasn&#039;t until the we met again at a mutual friends birthday party in 2006 that we decided to start dating - long distance. We have been long distance the entire engagment. When I finish grad school in May 2009, I am selling my house and finally moving to be with Chris!","Attachments":[],"Id":372193,"PostDate":1215528284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We dated for 4 months before we got engaged. I was SO surprised - we had talked about marriage very early on but I thought we would be like most \"normal\" couples and date for at least a year. When you know, you know!<br \/> <br \/> We were introduced to each other 2 years before we started dating - we lived half way across the country from each other and even though we hit it off almost immediately, it wasn't until the we met again at a mutual friends birthday party in 2006 that we decided to start dating - long distance. We have been long distance the entire engagment. When I finish grad school in May 2009, I am selling my house and finally moving to be with Chris!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eakloehn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1207348530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209017.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":83,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acire","Id":209017,"Name":"acire","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffc63cbffb03bdee945eb1f8cde0b89f","RawContent":"We were dating six moinths when he proposed to me. Never thought in a million years we would have gotten married that quickly. We&#039;ve now been married over 4 years and happy as ever!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":372555,"PostDate":1215539221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were dating six moinths when he proposed to me. Never thought in a million years we would have gotten married that quickly. We've now been married over 4 years and happy as ever!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Proud Mommy of two boys!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nestledinpa@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215451719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210373.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kim726","Id":210373,"Name":"Kim726","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70a0d8c7ddf846edc79d208ee20d4070","RawContent":"Lets see, we&#039;ll be together for a little over 12 years when we finally say I do! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":373350,"PostDate":1215576332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lets see, we'll be together for a little over 12 years when we finally say I do! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>~Kathy~<\/i><\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1267\/106\/20090511\/Since+we+said+I+DO%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1267\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i84.photobucket.com\/albums\/k1\/Cattiebri13\/05_5-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i84.photobucket.com\/albums\/k1...3\/05_5-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"KCarder3@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214687467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cattie","Id":210208,"Name":"Cattie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7af3b3fe3c65a56929cb7de95b8be34","RawContent":"We knew each other 3 months and 15 days when he proposed.\n \n He asked me out over 8 times before I went on a first date with him. I had every excuse under the sun to not go out with him, as I was &amp;quot;seeing&amp;quot; someone.\n Finally, I agree to go out with him on a Saturday and we have been inseperable since then!\n \n On our wedding day, we will have been together 2 years 7 months.","Attachments":[],"Id":373388,"PostDate":1215578758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We knew each other 3 months and 15 days when he proposed.<br \/> <br \/> He asked me out over 8 times before I went on a first date with him. I had every excuse under the sun to not go out with him, as I was \"seeing\" someone.<br \/> Finally, I agree to go out with him on a Saturday and we have been inseperable since then!<br \/> <br \/> On our wedding day, we will have been together 2 years 7 months.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;23\/st\/20100527\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/4315\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4315\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"puertorican1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1213749654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210022.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stkitts2010","Id":210022,"Name":"stkitts2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc013ff7bb4d49baf4bb4648962eb450","RawContent":"He proposed to me 1 year and 9 months after we started dating... although we moved in together after 6 months, so we did everything kinda quick. \n \n It is very true though, when you know, you know. \n \n I remember telling my mom 2 weeks after dating him that I will be marrying him and now it is less than 6 months away!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":375240,"PostDate":1215696424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                He proposed to me 1 year and 9 months after we started dating... although we moved in together after 6 months, so we did everything kinda quick. <br \/> <br \/> It is very true though, when you know, you know. <br \/> <br \/> I remember telling my mom 2 weeks after dating him that I will be marrying him and now it is less than 6 months away!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"boycemegan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215630199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210429.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MexicoBride09","Id":210429,"Name":"MexicoBride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbf66eea0fed4140d8c082ea71370766","RawContent":"We&#039;ve been dating since our first year in undergrad. We&#039;ve almost finished our MAs together (this year), and even though we&#039;re unofficially engaged (he&#039;s waiting for my ring - *sigh* the life of students, lol), &lt;strong&gt;he&lt;\/strong&gt; hopes to be married by 2010. &lt;strong&gt;I&#039;m&lt;\/strong&gt; hoping for 2011. \n \n If it goes according to plan, we might officially be engaged by 2009...which would be &lt;strong&gt;seven&lt;\/strong&gt; years of dating &lt;strong&gt;before&lt;\/strong&gt;getting engaged. And then depending on the years, an additional 1- 2 years before the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":387773,"PostDate":1216572640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We've been dating since our first year in undergrad. We've almost finished our MAs together (this year), and even though we're unofficially engaged (he's waiting for my ring - *sigh* the life of students, lol), <strong>he<\/strong> hopes to be married by 2010. <strong>I'm<\/strong> hoping for 2011. <br \/> <br \/> If it goes according to plan, we might officially be engaged by 2009...which would be <strong>seven<\/strong> years of dating <strong>before<\/strong>getting engaged. And then depending on the years, an additional 1- 2 years before the wedding.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1160\/957\/20110522\/I%5C%5C%5C%27m+a+Mrs%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1160\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tenielle_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204597614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208712.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NotYourAverageDW","Id":208712,"Name":"NotYourAverageDW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"528de9398918cb2fc95c7f21d383d264","RawContent":"We were dating for 4 years, engaged for 1 year and now married for 1 year! 6 years total :) It has been a great journey and to think it is only just starting...","Attachments":[],"Id":387785,"PostDate":1216573111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were dating for 4 years, engaged for 1 year and now married for 1 year! 6 years total <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It has been a great journey and to think it is only just starting...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"resehop@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1216419360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210635.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":83,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"resehop","Id":210635,"Name":"resehop","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d51bff8b0fed9c73f25a35c99c736a3","RawContent":"We had been dating about a year and 10 months when we got engaged. We moved in together after about 7 months of dating I think...It was so strange how it worked out but it just did!\n \n We will have been together just over 4 years when we get married.","Attachments":[],"Id":387820,"PostDate":1216575819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We had been dating about a year and 10 months when we got engaged. We moved in together after about 7 months of dating I think...It was so strange how it worked out but it just did!<br \/> <br \/> We will have been together just over 4 years when we get married.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llounds@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.218.210","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1215866280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210493.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Lo*","Id":210493,"Name":"*Lo*","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":875,"TotalPages":88,"CurrentPage":200,"NextPage":210,"PreviousPage":190,"LastPage":870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
