{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"929a78acb537abe4e40c02aaf51f0614","RawContent":"I was joking with my FI about how long it took him to ask and said &amp;quot;It only took 5 years, 2 months, *blank* days....blah blah blah.&amp;quot; He laughed and said &amp;quot;Knowing you, you really calculated that.&amp;quot; So I did &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;, I found a date duration calculator online and it was 5 years, 2 months, 30 days, 4 hours and 45 minutes from our first date till he proposed. He proposed in June 2008 and wanted to plan the wedding for October 2008. I told him he waited this long to propose that he could last a little longer. So we are getting married in May 2009, after over 6 years together.","Attachments":[],"Id":390367,"PostDate":1216740429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was joking with my FI about how long it took him to ask and said \"It only took 5 years, 2 months, *blank* days....blah blah blah.\" He laughed and said \"Knowing you, you really calculated that.\" So I did <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>, I found a date duration calculator online and it was 5 years, 2 months, 30 days, 4 hours and 45 minutes from our first date till he proposed. He proposed in June 2008 and wanted to plan the wedding for October 2008. I told him he waited this long to propose that he could last a little longer. So we are getting married in May 2009, after over 6 years together.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp339\/twinkle320\/pro4-1-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i425.photobucket.com\/albums\/p...pro4-1-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"twinkle320@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216133439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210550.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~*~Margie~*~","Id":210550,"Name":"~*~Margie~*~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8edf1d17648a5f993e3d27b4305a6ee","RawContent":"Our 13 year mark was Jan 14, 2008 and March 9, 2008 was the day he proposed. Getting married Nov 14, 2009.\n \n He&#039;s my first boyfriend and we&#039;ve been together since I was 16.","Attachments":[],"Id":390468,"PostDate":1216743106,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n      